{"meta":{"nbResults":95},"repertoires":{"60071":{"id":60071,"title":"Marsupilami- dubbing ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/marsupilami-dubbing-2026-09-25-12-00-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3058\/1790074848.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T12:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 11:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 12:00:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3058,"name":"Marsupilami- dubbing ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Szalona, pe\u0142na humoru przygoda, w kt\u00f3rej w centrum akcji znajduje si\u0119 prawdziwy psotnik \u2013 tajemnicze stworzenie MARSUPILAMI! W polskiej wersji j\u0119zykowej us\u0142yszymy plejad\u0119 gwiazd: Cezarego Pazur\u0119, Magdalen\u0119 Boczarsk\u0105, Mateusza Banasiuka i Tomasza O\u015bwieci\u0144skiego. Podczas rejsu all-inclusive David, Tess i ich synek odkrywaj\u0105 w swoim baga\u017cu uroczego, \u017c\u00f3\u0142tego stworka w czarne c\u0119tki, kt\u00f3rego niewyobra\u017calnie d\u0142ugi ogon i nieposkromiony temperament w mgnieniu oka zamieniaj\u0105 rodzinne wakacje w totalny chaos \u2013 zw\u0142aszcza gdy okazuje si\u0119, \u017ce nowego przyjaciela ch\u0142opca pr\u00f3buje odnale\u017a\u0107 zdecydowanie zbyt wiele os\u00f3b!<\/span><\/font><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div style=\"\">Francja, Belgia 2025<\/div><div style=\"\">czas: 98\u2019<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/7aufdriIfNs?si=NA3F_J2cGcsSBBYS\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3058\/1790074848.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60104":{"id":60104,"title":"Tony ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/tony-2026-09-25-13-15-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788189036.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T13:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 12:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 13:15:00"},"products":[{"id":29,"name":"bilet normalny 29","rawPrice":2900,"price":"29,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3046,"name":"Tony ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Anthony Bourdain \u2013 buntownik, outsider, g\u0142os pokolenia, jeden z najbardziej znanych szef\u00f3w kuchni i jedna z najwi\u0119kszych, najbardziej charyzmatycznych osobowo\u015bci telewizyjnych. Podr\u00f3\u017cnik, pisarz, odkrywca, kt\u00f3rego miliony ludzi na ca\u0142ym \u015bwiecie pokocha\u0142y za bezkompromisowy styl, mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107 do \u017cycia, szacunek do ludzi, odwag\u0119, ciekawo\u015b\u0107 \u015bwiata i autentyczno\u015b\u0107. TONY to historia pocz\u0105tk\u00f3w jego drogi \u2013 kim by\u0142, zanim sta\u0142 si\u0119 Anthonym Bourdainem.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Upalne lato 1976 roku, Provincetown \u2013 miasto pulsuj\u0105ce wolno\u015bci\u0105, seksem i energi\u0105. M\u0142ody, marz\u0105cy o karierze pisarza, Tony (Dominic Sessa), by podreperowa\u0107 bud\u017cet, trafia na zmywak do restauracji serwuj\u0105cej owoce morza, prowadzonej przez tajemniczego szefa kuchni (Antonio Banderas). W intensywnej, chaotycznej, a jednocze\u015bnie niezwykle kreatywnej atmosferze Tony odkrywa swoj\u0105 pasj\u0119, powo\u0142anie i to, kim tak naprawd\u0119 jest.<br><br><br>CZAS TRWANIA: 106 min.<br><br><br><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/uI88YvjFdgE?si=Phxn31Jy5UORGEXA\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T2D4342","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788189036.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60064":{"id":60064,"title":"Kumotry ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kumotry-2026-09-25-13-30-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1780645915.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T13:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":12,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 13:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 13:30:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":12}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2975,"name":"Kumotry ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Pustoszej\u0105ca polska wie\u015b w rumu\u0144skich Karpatach: wzruszaj\u0105cy film o pami\u0119ci, przyja\u017ani i przemijaniu. <br><br>Historia przyja\u017ani kobiet zamieszkuj\u0105cych wymieraj\u0105c\u0105 polsk\u0105 wie\u015b w rumu\u0144skich Karpatach. Hanka i Bronka pochowa\u0142y ju\u017c m\u0119\u017c\u00f3w, dzieci wyjecha\u0142y za granic\u0119 w poszukiwaniu innych, lepszych perspektyw. Samodzielne i niezale\u017cne bohaterki imponuj\u0105 pogod\u0105 ducha, cho\u0107 ich rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107 nieub\u0142aganie odchodzi w przesz\u0142o\u015b\u0107. Pozostaj\u0105 wspomnienia o czasach, kt\u00f3re ju\u017c nie wr\u00f3c\u0105 \u2013 i wsp\u00f3lne stawianie czo\u0142a wyzwaniom codzienno\u015bci. Nostalgiczny obraz nikn\u0105cego \u015bwiata skrzy si\u0119 bezpretensjonalnym humorem i zachwyca zdj\u0119ciami, oddaj\u0105cymi zniewalaj\u0105cy urok karpackiego pog\u00f3rza. Zwracaj\u0105c uwag\u0119 na szczeg\u00f3\u0142y, re\u017cyserka tworzy wzruszaj\u0105cy film o pami\u0119ci, przyja\u017ani i przemijaniu. Pokazuj\u0105c ludzi, kt\u00f3rzy potrafi\u0105 by\u0107 dla siebie wszystkim, sk\u0142ania nas do przewarto\u015bciowania priorytet\u00f3w i spojrzenia na rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107 z mniej ucz\u0119szczanej strony.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/WWeJxcoEvH0?si=MeApd5ksdM9Q6oq4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D6143","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1780645915.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60078":{"id":60078,"title":"Gorzkie \u015bwi\u0119ta ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/gorzkie-swieta-2026-09-25-13-45-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3003\/1784016423.png","date":"2026-09-26T13:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 13:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 13:45:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3003,"name":"Gorzkie \u015bwi\u0119ta ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Pedro Almod\u00f3var powraca w szczytowej formie z jednym ze swoich najbardziej osobistych film\u00f3w. W \u201eGorzkich \u015bwi\u0119tach\u201d - jego pierwszej od 5 lat hiszpa\u0144skoj\u0119zycznej produkcji - jest wszystko, za co widzowie kochaj\u0105 jego kino: nami\u0119tno\u015b\u0107, intensywne kolory, przewrotny humor i pe\u0142nokrwiste postaci, kt\u00f3re wymykaj\u0105 si\u0119 prostym schematom. Na ekranie pojawiaj\u0105 si\u0119 aktorzy i aktorki znani z wcze\u015bniejszych film\u00f3w re\u017cysera: B\u00e1rbara Lennie, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Victoria Luengo, Aitana S\u00e1nchez-Gij\u00f3n, Milena Smit oraz jedna z najwa\u017cniejszych muz Almod\u00f3vara \u2013 Rossy de Palma. <br><br>Bohaterk\u0105 filmu jest czterdziestoletnia Elza (B\u00e1rbara Lennie), kt\u00f3ra po \u015bmierci matki rzuca si\u0119 w wir pracy, nie pozwalaj\u0105c sobie na \u017ca\u0142ob\u0119. Dopiero atak paniki zmusza j\u0105 do zatrzymania si\u0119 i wyruszenia w podr\u00f3\u017c, kt\u00f3ra stanie si\u0119 konfrontacj\u0105 z przesz\u0142o\u015bci\u0105, utraconymi relacjami i niespe\u0142nionymi pragnieniami. Z przypadkowych spotka\u0144, emocjonalnych zwrot\u00f3w i splataj\u0105cych si\u0119 \u017cyciorys\u00f3w Almod\u00f3var tka opowie\u015b\u0107 o tym, jak pami\u0119\u0107, fikcja i pragnienie nieustannie przepisuj\u0105 nasze \u017cycie. <br><br>\u201eGorzkie \u015bwi\u0119ta\u201d to szczeg\u00f3lny prezent dla tych, kt\u00f3rzy dorastali z kinem hiszpa\u0144skiego mistrza \u2013 od \u201eKobiet na skraju za\u0142amania nerwowego\u201d, przez \u201eWszystko o mojej matce\u201d i \u201ePorozmawiaj z ni\u0105\u201d, po \u201eVolver\u201d, \u201ePrzerwane obj\u0119cia\u201d i \u201eB\u00f3l i blask\u201d. To tak\u017ce film, kt\u00f3ry idzie o krok dalej: jeszcze mocniej pokazuje, \u017ce ka\u017cdy z nas nie tylko prze\u017cywa w\u0142asn\u0105 histori\u0119, ale te\u017c bez ko\u0144ca j\u0105 sobie opowiada. Almod\u00f3var sk\u0142ada tu poruszaj\u0105ce wyznanie wiary w si\u0142\u0119 kina, pami\u0119ci i narracji.<\/span><br><br><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div style=\"\">re\u017cyseria: Pedro Almod\u00f3var<\/div><div style=\"\">aktorzy: B\u00e1rbara Lennie, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Aitana S\u00e1nchez-Gij\u00f3n, Victoria Luengo, Patrick Criado, Milena Smit, Quim Guti\u00e9rrez, Rossy de Palma, Carmen Machi<\/div><div style=\"\">Hiszpania 2026,111'<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/Nz7UX762UoA?si=qTp0m6qAgt8LR01B\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T2D4118","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3003\/1784016423.png","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60057":{"id":60057,"title":"Kura ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kura-2026-09-25-15-00-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786965128.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T15:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":11,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 14:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 15:00:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":11}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3030,"name":"Kura ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">G\u0142\u00f3wn\u0105 bohaterk\u0105 nowego filmu w\u0119gierskiego re\u017cysera Gy\u00f6rgya P\u00e1lfiego jest tytu\u0142owa kura. Pozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.<br><br>Trafia do greckiej nadmorskiej wioski, gdzie schwytana zostaje przez w\u0142a\u015bciciela podupad\u0142ej restauracji i si\u0142\u0105 rzeczy \u201ewchodzi\u201d do ludzkiego \u015bwiata. Jest uwa\u017cn\u0105 obserwatork\u0105 zupe\u0142nie obcej dla niej rzeczywisto\u015bci. Staje si\u0119 te\u017c niemym \u015bwiadkiem ludzkich dramat\u00f3w, zwi\u0105zanych z kryzysem migracyjnym, rodzinnymi konfliktami czy chciwo\u015bci\u0105. <br><br>W rol\u0119 g\u0142\u00f3wnej bohaterki wcieli\u0142o si\u0119 osiem prawdziwych w\u0119gierskich kur: Eszti, Szandi, Feri, Enci, Eti, Enik\u0151, N\u00f3ra i Anett. <br><br>Przyjmuj\u0105c nieoczywist\u0105 perspektyw\u0119, P\u00e1lfi opowiada o uniwersalnych warto\u015bciach \u2013 wolno\u015bci, bezpiecze\u0144stwie, macierzy\u0144stwie \u2013 jakich poszukuj\u0105 jak wida\u0107 nie tylko ludzie. W\u0119gierski re\u017cyser odwa\u017cnie \u0142\u0105czy filmowe gatunki, tworz\u0105c histori\u0119, kt\u00f3ra z jednej strony mo\u017ce nas bawi\u0107, a z drugiej jest prawdziwie poruszaj\u0105ca.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/L78WO1p_xnA?si=GsO3moP7sAFn8x5D\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D10792","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786965128.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60108":{"id":60108,"title":"Mistyczka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/mistyczka-2026-09-25-15-15-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T15:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 14:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 15:15:00"},"products":[{"id":29,"name":"bilet normalny 29","rawPrice":2900,"price":"29,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3059,"name":"Mistyczka ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to poruszaj\u0105ca, inspirowana prawdziwymi wydarzeniami historia kobiety, kt\u00f3ra odwa\u017cy\u0142a si\u0119 p\u00f3j\u015b\u0107 za g\u0142osem serca i przekroczy\u0107 granic\u0119 tego, co znane. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o wewn\u0119trznej przemianie, poszukiwaniu sensu egzystencji i niezwyk\u0142ej drodze, kt\u00f3ra zaprowadzi\u0142a Alicj\u0119 Lenczewsk\u0105 do do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 wykraczaj\u0105cych poza materialn\u0105 rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Przez lata Alicja Lenczewska prowadzi\u0142a dynamiczne \u017cycie. By\u0142a wiernym cz\u0142onkiem partii komunistycznej i cenion\u0105 nauczycielk\u0105 \u2013 wymagaj\u0105c\u0105, odpowiedzialn\u0105 i ca\u0142kowicie oddan\u0105 swojej pracy. Uwielbia\u0142a zagraniczne podr\u00f3\u017ce. Wydawa\u0142o si\u0119, \u017ce jej przysz\u0142o\u015b\u0107 zosta\u0142a ju\u017c dawno napisana. A\u017c do dnia, w kt\u00f3rym jedno spotkanie odmieni\u0142o wszystko\u2026<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wbrew sceptycyzmowi otoczenia i w\u0142asnym l\u0119kom Alicja wkracza na \u015bcie\u017ck\u0119 g\u0142\u0119bokiego \u017cycia duchowego. Jej mistyczne zapiski pe\u0142ne szczero\u015bci, nadziei i m\u0105dro\u015bci z czasem trafiaj\u0105 do tysi\u0119cy ludzi szukaj\u0105cych odpowiedzi na najwa\u017cniejsze pytania o mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107, cierpienie, wiar\u0119 i sens \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to film, kt\u00f3ry porusza serce i sk\u0142ania do refleksji. Intymny portret niezwyk\u0142ej kobiety splata si\u0119 tu z uniwersaln\u0105 opowie\u015bci\u0105 o samotno\u015bci, odwadze i potrzebie odnalezienia \u015bwiat\u0142a nawet w najtrudniejszych momentach \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W roli Alicji Lenczewskiej wyst\u0119puje Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, tworz\u0105c jedn\u0105 z najbardziej poruszaj\u0105cych i dojrza\u0142ych kreacji w swojej karierze.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017c.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Jan Sobierajski<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">obsada&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Rados\u0142aw Pazura, Rafa\u0142 Sza\u0142ajko, Marcin Kwa\u015bny, Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, S\u0142awomir Orzechowski, Dariusz Kowalski, Filip Gur\u0142acz<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/oQiqr0HaqLA?si=lQmbZcfw6CEuHFPd\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60083":{"id":60083,"title":"Obcy ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/obcy-2026-09-25-15-45-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","date":"2026-09-26T15:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 15:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 15:45:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3022,"name":"Obcy ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d w re\u017cyserii Fran\u00e7ois Ozona to nowa ekranizacja jednej z najwybitniejszych francuskich powie\u015bci XX wieku autorstwa Alberta Camusa. Prezentowana w Konkursie G\u0142\u00f3wnym festiwalu w Wenecji&nbsp; to wci\u0105\u017c niezwykle aktualna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu sensu w \u015bwiecie, w kt\u00f3rym wszelki sens zosta\u0142 zagubiony.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d jest histori\u0105 Meursaulta, m\u0142odego m\u0119\u017cczyzny, skromnego urz\u0119dnika, kt\u00f3rego codziennej rutyny nie przerywa nawet \u015bmier\u0107 matki. Wszystko zmienia si\u0119 pewnego gor\u0105cego dnia, gdy na pla\u017cy dochodzi do tragicznego zdarzenia z jego udzia\u0142em.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Oszcz\u0119dne dialogi i pi\u0119kne czarno-bia\u0142e zdj\u0119cia, b\u0119d\u0105ce ho\u0142dem dla klasycznego kina, buduj\u0105 wyj\u0105tkow\u0105 atmosfer\u0119 filmu.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Re\u017cyseria: Fran\u00e7ois Ozon<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Benjamin Voisin, Rebecca Marder, Pierre Lottin, Denis Lavant, Swann Arlaud<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Francja 2025, 122'<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/b2yaQbsNAk0?si=m6suXUoNcKv7bWOG\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D10184","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60043":{"id":60043,"title":"Orlando ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/orlando-2026-09-25-16-45-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3050\/1789035126.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T16:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 16:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 16:45:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3050,"name":"Orlando ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W roku 1600 Orlando, m\u0142odzieniec z arystokratycznego rodu (Tilda Swinton), zostaje obrzucony kl\u0105tw\u0105 \"bycia m\u0142odym na wieki\" przez oczarowan\u0105 jego urod\u0105 kr\u00f3low\u0105 El\u017cbiet\u0119 I. 200 lat p\u00f3\u017aniej zostaje kobiet\u0105, kt\u00f3rej losy \u015bledzimy a\u017c po lata nam wsp\u00f3lczesne. Ubrana w pi\u0119kne obrazy lekko ironiczna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu w\u0142asnej to\u017csamo\u015bci. Film powsta\u0142 na podstawie powie\u015bci Virginii Wolf.<\/span><\/font><div><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017cyseria<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t<\/span>Sally Potter<\/span><\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Scenariusz Sally Potter<\/span><\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Obsada&nbsp;<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t<\/span>Tilda Swinton, Quentin Crisp, John Bott, Elaine Banham, Anna Farnworth<\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/div><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/SbT1KRbOn7o?si=a1OJGVu5KQsn5Tig\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"1992T2D454","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3050\/1789035126.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60101":{"id":60101,"title":"Wind\u0105 na szafot ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/winda-na-szafot-2026-09-26-17-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3056\/1789989931.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T17:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 16:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 17:00:00"},"products":[{"id":29,"name":"bilet normalny 29","rawPrice":2900,"price":"29,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3056,"name":"Wind\u0105 na szafot ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Pary\u017c w rytmie jazzu, zbrodnia w rytmie serca.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eWind\u0105 na szafot\u201d (Ascenseur pour l\u2019\u00e9chafaud) z 1958 roku to nie tylko debiut fabularny Louisa Malle\u2019a, ale kamie\u0144 milowy, kt\u00f3ry przetar\u0142 szlaki dla francuskiej Nowej Fali. Legendarne dzie\u0142o niepokornego tw\u00f3rcy znad Sekwany to stylowy krymina\u0142 noir, w kt\u00f3rym melancholijna atmosfera paryskich ulic by\u0107 mo\u017ce jest nawet wa\u017cniejsza od fabularnej intrygi. W centrum historii jest zbrodnia pope\u0142niona przez Juliana Taverniera na m\u0119\u017cu swojej kochanki. Mo\u017ce to morderstwo by\u0142oby doskona\u0142e, gdyby nie \u201edrobny\u201d szczeg\u00f3\u0142, kt\u00f3ry powoduje, \u017ce Julian musi wr\u00f3ci\u0107 na miejsce zbrodni.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eWind\u0105 na szafot\u201d to przede wszystkim nastrojowe kino osi\u0105gni\u0119te pionierskim zastosowaniem ma\u0142ych kamer, swobodn\u0105 konstrukcj\u0105, pi\u0119knymi zdj\u0119ciami i niezapomnian\u0105, stworzon\u0105 w ci\u0105gu doby, legendarn\u0105 muzyk\u0105 geniusza jazzu \u2013 Milesa Daviesa. To tak\u017ce pierwszy film w kt\u00f3rym mog\u0142a ods\u0142oni\u0107 sw\u00f3j talent przysz\u0142a ikona francuskiego kina \u2013 Jeanne Moreau.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Francja 1957, 91\u2019<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><div style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Re\u017cyseria: Louis Malle<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Muzyka: Miles Davis<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Scenariusz: Roger Nimier, Louis Malle (oparty na powie\u015bci Noela Calefa \u201eWind\u0105 na szafot\u201d)<\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Jeanne Moreau, Maurice Ronet, Georges Poujouly, Yori Bertin<\/span><\/div><\/font><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3056\/1789989931.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60095":{"id":60095,"title":"Mistyczka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/mistyczka-2026-09-25-18-00-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T18:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":33,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 17:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 18:00:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":33}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3059,"name":"Mistyczka ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to poruszaj\u0105ca, inspirowana prawdziwymi wydarzeniami historia kobiety, kt\u00f3ra odwa\u017cy\u0142a si\u0119 p\u00f3j\u015b\u0107 za g\u0142osem serca i przekroczy\u0107 granic\u0119 tego, co znane. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o wewn\u0119trznej przemianie, poszukiwaniu sensu egzystencji i niezwyk\u0142ej drodze, kt\u00f3ra zaprowadzi\u0142a Alicj\u0119 Lenczewsk\u0105 do do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 wykraczaj\u0105cych poza materialn\u0105 rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Przez lata Alicja Lenczewska prowadzi\u0142a dynamiczne \u017cycie. By\u0142a wiernym cz\u0142onkiem partii komunistycznej i cenion\u0105 nauczycielk\u0105 \u2013 wymagaj\u0105c\u0105, odpowiedzialn\u0105 i ca\u0142kowicie oddan\u0105 swojej pracy. Uwielbia\u0142a zagraniczne podr\u00f3\u017ce. Wydawa\u0142o si\u0119, \u017ce jej przysz\u0142o\u015b\u0107 zosta\u0142a ju\u017c dawno napisana. A\u017c do dnia, w kt\u00f3rym jedno spotkanie odmieni\u0142o wszystko\u2026<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wbrew sceptycyzmowi otoczenia i w\u0142asnym l\u0119kom Alicja wkracza na \u015bcie\u017ck\u0119 g\u0142\u0119bokiego \u017cycia duchowego. Jej mistyczne zapiski pe\u0142ne szczero\u015bci, nadziei i m\u0105dro\u015bci z czasem trafiaj\u0105 do tysi\u0119cy ludzi szukaj\u0105cych odpowiedzi na najwa\u017cniejsze pytania o mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107, cierpienie, wiar\u0119 i sens \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to film, kt\u00f3ry porusza serce i sk\u0142ania do refleksji. Intymny portret niezwyk\u0142ej kobiety splata si\u0119 tu z uniwersaln\u0105 opowie\u015bci\u0105 o samotno\u015bci, odwadze i potrzebie odnalezienia \u015bwiat\u0142a nawet w najtrudniejszych momentach \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W roli Alicji Lenczewskiej wyst\u0119puje Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, tworz\u0105c jedn\u0105 z najbardziej poruszaj\u0105cych i dojrza\u0142ych kreacji w swojej karierze.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017c.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Jan Sobierajski<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">obsada&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Rados\u0142aw Pazura, Rafa\u0142 Sza\u0142ajko, Marcin Kwa\u015bny, Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, S\u0142awomir Orzechowski, Dariusz Kowalski, Filip Gur\u0142acz<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/oQiqr0HaqLA?si=lQmbZcfw6CEuHFPd\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60050":{"id":60050,"title":"Birthday Party ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/birthday-party-2026-09-25-18-30-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1790073908.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T18:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 18:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 18:30:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3057,"name":"Birthday Party ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wp\u0142ywowy grecki magnat \u015bwi\u0119tuje 25. urodziny c\u00f3rki na prywatnej wyspie otoczony gronem najpot\u0119\u017cniejszych ludzi \u015bwiata. W miar\u0119 rozwoju przyj\u0119cia na jaw zaczynaj\u0105 wychodzi\u0107 mroczne sekrety zebranych.<\/span><\/font><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017c. Miguel \u00c1ngel Jim\u00e9nez<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">obsada&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t<\/span>Willem Dafoe, Vic Carmen Sonne, Joe Cole<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div style=\"\">produkcja: Grecja, Hiszpania, Holandia, Wielka Brytania 2026<\/div><div style=\"\">j\u0119zyk: angielski<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/q66_3aPe6OA?si=5QPi75GoE7XsBJG6\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1790073908.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60116":{"id":60116,"title":"Obcy ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/obcy-2026-09-25-18-45-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","date":"2026-09-26T18:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 18:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 18:45:00"},"products":[{"id":29,"name":"bilet normalny 29","rawPrice":2900,"price":"29,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3022,"name":"Obcy ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d w re\u017cyserii Fran\u00e7ois Ozona to nowa ekranizacja jednej z najwybitniejszych francuskich powie\u015bci XX wieku autorstwa Alberta Camusa. Prezentowana w Konkursie G\u0142\u00f3wnym festiwalu w Wenecji&nbsp; to wci\u0105\u017c niezwykle aktualna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu sensu w \u015bwiecie, w kt\u00f3rym wszelki sens zosta\u0142 zagubiony.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d jest histori\u0105 Meursaulta, m\u0142odego m\u0119\u017cczyzny, skromnego urz\u0119dnika, kt\u00f3rego codziennej rutyny nie przerywa nawet \u015bmier\u0107 matki. Wszystko zmienia si\u0119 pewnego gor\u0105cego dnia, gdy na pla\u017cy dochodzi do tragicznego zdarzenia z jego udzia\u0142em.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Oszcz\u0119dne dialogi i pi\u0119kne czarno-bia\u0142e zdj\u0119cia, b\u0119d\u0105ce ho\u0142dem dla klasycznego kina, buduj\u0105 wyj\u0105tkow\u0105 atmosfer\u0119 filmu.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Re\u017cyseria: Fran\u00e7ois Ozon<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Benjamin Voisin, Rebecca Marder, Pierre Lottin, Denis Lavant, Swann Arlaud<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Francja 2025, 122'<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/b2yaQbsNAk0?si=m6suXUoNcKv7bWOG\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D10184","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60090":{"id":60090,"title":"Powiedz mi, co czujesz ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/powiedz-mi-co-czujesz-2026-09-25-19-30-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789035367.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T19:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 19:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 19:30:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3051,"name":"Powiedz mi, co czujesz ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201ePowiedz mi, co czujesz\u201d to subtelna opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142o\u015bci dwojga m\u0142odych artyst\u00f3w, dla kt\u00f3rych pierwszy powa\u017cny zwi\u0105zek w doros\u0142ym \u017cyciu staje si\u0119 lustrem ich dawnych do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 i blizn. W rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych wyst\u0119puj\u0105 obiecuj\u0105cy aktorzy m\u0142odego pokolenia: Jan Sa\u0142asi\u0144ski, Izabella Dudziak oraz Sebastian Dela. Film jest inspirowany \u017cyciem i tw\u00f3rczo\u015bci\u0105 Patryka R\u00f3\u017cyckiego oraz Karoliny Balcer i projektem artystycznym \u201eSkup \u0141ez\u201d Alicji Rogalskiej i \u0141ukasza Surowca. <br><br>Bohaterowie maj\u0105 po dwadzie\u015bcia lat. Ona tworzy nietypowy projekt SKUP \u0141EZ, w kt\u00f3rym p\u0142aci ludziom za ich\u2026 \u0142zy. On - pocz\u0105tkuj\u0105cy artysta - nie potrafi p\u0142aka\u0107. Ich uczucie rozwija si\u0119 intensywnie i szybko, otwieraj\u0105c drog\u0119 do g\u0142\u0119bokiej przemiany, kt\u00f3ra oka\u017ce si\u0119 jednym z najwa\u017cniejszych do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 w ich \u017cyciu. \u201ePowiedz mi, co czujesz\u201d to poruszaj\u0105ca historia o intymnej blisko\u015bci i mi\u0142o\u015bci, kt\u00f3ra potrafi by\u0107 najlepszym terapeut\u0105.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/-gi8nuA6FRY?si=JywVNH1jU8tD5FCD\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T3D4311","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789035367.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60036":{"id":60036,"title":"Requiem dla snu  ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/requiem-dla-snu-2026-09-25-20-30-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/2997\/1784032934.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T20:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":10,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 20:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2997,"name":"Requiem dla snu  ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to drugi pe\u0142nometra\u017cowy film Darrena Aronofsky\u2019ego, na podstawie powie\u015bci legendarnego ameryka\u0144skiego pisarza, Huberta Selby\u2019ego Jr. \u0106wier\u0107 wieku temu trafi\u0142 do Polski dzi\u0119ki dystrybucji Gutek Film i wry\u0142 si\u0119 w nasz\u0105 popkultur\u0119 tak g\u0142\u0119boko, \u017ce sta\u0142 si\u0119 niezwykle wa\u017cnym tekstem kultury, cytowanym przez pisarzy, tw\u00f3rc\u00f3w teatralnych i raper\u00f3w. M\u0142odzi wtedy aktorzy - Jared Leto, Jennifer Connelly i Marlon Wayans - z dnia na dzie\u0144 trafili na hollywoodzki szczyt, hipnotyzuj\u0105cy popis Ellen Burstyn przyni\u00f3s\u0142 jej nominacj\u0119 do Oscara, a sam re\u017cyser udowodni\u0142, \u017ce jest wizjonerem kina. Teraz, po 25 latach od premiery, film powraca do kin w odrestaurowanej wersji 4K. <br><br>\u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to wstrz\u0105saj\u0105ca opowie\u015b\u0107 o czw\u00f3rce bohater\u00f3w z Brooklynu, kt\u00f3rzy w pogoni za realizacj\u0105 swoich marze\u0144 odbywaj\u0105 podr\u00f3\u017c w g\u0142\u0105b piek\u0142a uzale\u017cnie\u0144. Dla rozprowadzaj\u0105cego narkotyki Harry'ego (Leto), jego uzale\u017cnionej od pigu\u0142ek na odchudzanie matki (Burstyn), pogr\u0105\u017conej w na\u0142ogu dziewczyny (Connelly) i najlepszego przyjaciela (Wayans) ucieczka od rzeczywisto\u015bci ko\u0144czy si\u0119 tragedi\u0105. Nie mog\u0105c sobie poradzi\u0107 z chaosem otaczaj\u0105cego ich wsp\u00f3\u0142czesnego \u015bwiata, ka\u017cde z nich popada w uzale\u017cnienie - od narkotyk\u00f3w, s\u0142odyczy lub telewizji.&nbsp; \u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to hipnotyczna opowie\u015b\u0107 o t\u0119sknocie za mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105, \u017cyciu w iluzji i k\u0142amstwie oraz o pu\u0142apce na\u0142ogu. <br><br>Ekranowego dramatu bohater\u00f3w dope\u0142nia genialny, \u015bwidruj\u0105cy m\u00f3zg soundtrack Clinta Mansella w wykonaniu Kronos Quartet. Motyw Lux Aeterna to muzyczny klasyk, po dzi\u015b dzie\u0144 bezlito\u015bnie przerabiany i samplowany. A samo \u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d, ogl\u0105dane po latach, wci\u0105\u017c funduje widzom szokuj\u0105cy, emocjonalny rollercoaster, po kt\u00f3rym trudno doj\u015b\u0107 do siebie.<\/span><\/font>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2001T2D135","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/2997\/1784032934.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60121":{"id":60121,"title":"Martwe z\u0142o 2 ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/martwe-zlo-2-2026-09-25-21-00-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3060\/1790077975.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T21:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":121,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 20:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 21:00:00"},"products":[{"id":29,"name":"bilet normalny 29","rawPrice":2900,"price":"29,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":121}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3060,"name":"Martwe z\u0142o 2 ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Ash Williams (Bruce Campbell) zabiera dziewczyn\u0119 do odludnej chaty w lesie na romantyczny weekend. Na miejscu znajduje magnetofon z nagraniem inkantacji z Necronomiconu, Ksi\u0119gi Umar\u0142ych \u2013 i naciska \u201eplay\u201d. To b\u0142\u0105d. Demony budz\u0105 si\u0119 natychmiast, dziewczyna zmienia si\u0119 w rozchichotane truch\u0142o, a sam Ash rozpoczyna najd\u0142u\u017csz\u0105 noc swojego \u017cycia: noc, podczas kt\u00f3rej jego w\u0142asna d\u0142o\u0144 zwr\u00f3ci si\u0119 przeciwko niemu, meble wybuchn\u0105 zbiorowym \u015bmiechem, a jedynym rozs\u0105dnym rozwi\u0105zaniem oka\u017ce si\u0119 pi\u0142a mechaniczna zamontowana na kikucie.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eMartwe z\u0142o 2\u201d Sama Raimiego to jeden z najzabawniejszych paradoks\u00f3w historii kina: sequel, kt\u00f3ry jest jednocze\u015bnie remakiem, parodi\u0105 i przelicytowaniem orygina\u0142u \u2013 i kt\u00f3ry zdefiniowa\u0142 gatunek splatstick, czyli slapstick zanurzony po \u0142okcie w hektolitrach posoki. Raimi, dysponuj\u0105c wreszcie porz\u0105dnym bud\u017cetem, przekszta\u0142ci\u0142 surowy horror swojego debiutu w kresk\u00f3wk\u0119 na \u017cywo: kamera szar\u017cuje przez las jak op\u0119tana (s\u0142ynne uj\u0119cia \u201ez perspektywy z\u0142a\u201d kr\u0119cono, przywi\u0105zuj\u0105c kamer\u0119 do deski niesionej przez biegn\u0105cych operator\u00f3w), scenografia jest wsp\u00f3\u0142sprawc\u0105 przemocy, a groza i groteska przestaj\u0105 by\u0107 przeciwie\u0144stwami, zlewaj\u0105c si\u0119 w jeden rozp\u0119dzony \u017cywio\u0142.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Ale prawdziwym cudem filmu jest Bruce Campbell. Jego Ash to arcydzie\u0142o fizycznej komedii: cz\u0142owiek ok\u0142adany przez ca\u0142y wszech\u015bwiat (w tym przez samego siebie \u2013 walka z w\u0142asn\u0105 r\u0119k\u0105 to pi\u0119\u0107 minut czystego geniuszu), kt\u00f3ry z ofiary przepoczwarza si\u0119 w przerysowanego macho. Kreacja ta uczyni\u0142a z Campbella wiecznego kr\u00f3la kina klasy B, a z Asha \u2013 jednego z najukocha\u0144szych bohater\u00f3w popkultury. W 4K ka\u017cda kropla sztucznej krwi (a s\u0105 jej tysi\u0105ce) l\u015bni jak nowa. [Grzegorz Fortuna<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div>Re\u017cyseria: Sam Raimi | Produkcja: USA, 1987 | Czas: 84'<\/div><div>Wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Bruce Campbell, Sarah Berry, Dan Hicks<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3060\/1790077975.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"59632":{"id":59632,"title":"Kino a psychoanaliza: Powiedz mi, co czujesz ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kino-a-psychoanaliza-powiedz-mi-co-czujesz-2026-09-27-12-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787226713.jpg","date":"2026-09-27T12:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":88,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 11:30:00","startAt":"2026-08-20 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 12:00:00"},"products":[{"id":98,"name":"Bilet specjalny 32","rawPrice":3200,"price":"32,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":88}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3041,"name":"Kino a psychoanaliza: Powiedz mi, co czujesz ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 13.3333px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\">Kino Mikro i Ma\u0142opolsko-Podkarpacki Oddzia\u0142 Polskiego Towarzystwa Psychoterapii Psychoanalitycznej zapraszaj\u0105 na pokaz specjalny filmu \"Powiedz mi co czujesz\".<\/span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W dyskusji udzia\u0142 wezm\u0105: <\/span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u2728 Marta Flasza - psycholo\u017cka i psychoterapeutka psychoanalityczna <\/span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u2728 Anna Taszycka - filmoznawczyni.<\/span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201ePowiedz mi, co czujesz\u201d to subtelna opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142o\u015bci dwojga m\u0142odych artyst\u00f3w, dla kt\u00f3rych pierwszy powa\u017cny zwi\u0105zek w doros\u0142ym \u017cyciu staje si\u0119 lustrem ich dawnych do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 i blizn. W rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych wyst\u0119puj\u0105 obiecuj\u0105cy aktorzy m\u0142odego pokolenia: Jan Sa\u0142asi\u0144ski, Izabella Dudziak oraz Sebastian Dela. Film jest inspirowany \u017cyciem i tw\u00f3rczo\u015bci\u0105 Patryka R\u00f3\u017cyckiego oraz Karoliny Balcer i projektem artystycznym \u201eSkup \u0141ez\u201d Alicji Rogalskiej i \u0141ukasza Surowca. <br><br>Bohaterowie maj\u0105 po dwadzie\u015bcia lat. Ona tworzy nietypowy projekt SKUP \u0141EZ, w kt\u00f3rym p\u0142aci ludziom za ich\u2026 \u0142zy. On - pocz\u0105tkuj\u0105cy artysta - nie potrafi p\u0142aka\u0107. Ich uczucie rozwija si\u0119 intensywnie i szybko, otwieraj\u0105c drog\u0119 do g\u0142\u0119bokiej przemiany, kt\u00f3ra oka\u017ce si\u0119 jednym z najwa\u017cniejszych do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 w ich \u017cyciu. \u201ePowiedz mi, co czujesz\u201d to poruszaj\u0105ca historia o intymnej blisko\u015bci i mi\u0142o\u015bci, kt\u00f3ra potrafi by\u0107 najlepszym terapeut\u0105.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/-gi8nuA6FRY?si=JywVNH1jU8tD5FCD\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787226713.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60065":{"id":60065,"title":"Kumotry ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kumotry-2026-09-25-13-30-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1780645915.jpg","date":"2026-09-27T13:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 13:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 13:30:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2975,"name":"Kumotry ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Pustoszej\u0105ca polska wie\u015b w rumu\u0144skich Karpatach: wzruszaj\u0105cy film o pami\u0119ci, przyja\u017ani i przemijaniu. <br><br>Historia przyja\u017ani kobiet zamieszkuj\u0105cych wymieraj\u0105c\u0105 polsk\u0105 wie\u015b w rumu\u0144skich Karpatach. Hanka i Bronka pochowa\u0142y ju\u017c m\u0119\u017c\u00f3w, dzieci wyjecha\u0142y za granic\u0119 w poszukiwaniu innych, lepszych perspektyw. Samodzielne i niezale\u017cne bohaterki imponuj\u0105 pogod\u0105 ducha, cho\u0107 ich rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107 nieub\u0142aganie odchodzi w przesz\u0142o\u015b\u0107. Pozostaj\u0105 wspomnienia o czasach, kt\u00f3re ju\u017c nie wr\u00f3c\u0105 \u2013 i wsp\u00f3lne stawianie czo\u0142a wyzwaniom codzienno\u015bci. Nostalgiczny obraz nikn\u0105cego \u015bwiata skrzy si\u0119 bezpretensjonalnym humorem i zachwyca zdj\u0119ciami, oddaj\u0105cymi zniewalaj\u0105cy urok karpackiego pog\u00f3rza. Zwracaj\u0105c uwag\u0119 na szczeg\u00f3\u0142y, re\u017cyserka tworzy wzruszaj\u0105cy film o pami\u0119ci, przyja\u017ani i przemijaniu. Pokazuj\u0105c ludzi, kt\u00f3rzy potrafi\u0105 by\u0107 dla siebie wszystkim, sk\u0142ania nas do przewarto\u015bciowania priorytet\u00f3w i spojrzenia na rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107 z mniej ucz\u0119szczanej strony.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/WWeJxcoEvH0?si=MeApd5ksdM9Q6oq4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D6143","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1780645915.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60058":{"id":60058,"title":"Kura ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kura-2026-09-25-15-00-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786965128.jpg","date":"2026-09-27T15:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 14:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 15:00:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3030,"name":"Kura ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">G\u0142\u00f3wn\u0105 bohaterk\u0105 nowego filmu w\u0119gierskiego re\u017cysera Gy\u00f6rgya P\u00e1lfiego jest tytu\u0142owa kura. Pozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.<br><br>Trafia do greckiej nadmorskiej wioski, gdzie schwytana zostaje przez w\u0142a\u015bciciela podupad\u0142ej restauracji i si\u0142\u0105 rzeczy \u201ewchodzi\u201d do ludzkiego \u015bwiata. Jest uwa\u017cn\u0105 obserwatork\u0105 zupe\u0142nie obcej dla niej rzeczywisto\u015bci. Staje si\u0119 te\u017c niemym \u015bwiadkiem ludzkich dramat\u00f3w, zwi\u0105zanych z kryzysem migracyjnym, rodzinnymi konfliktami czy chciwo\u015bci\u0105. <br><br>W rol\u0119 g\u0142\u00f3wnej bohaterki wcieli\u0142o si\u0119 osiem prawdziwych w\u0119gierskich kur: Eszti, Szandi, Feri, Enci, Eti, Enik\u0151, N\u00f3ra i Anett. <br><br>Przyjmuj\u0105c nieoczywist\u0105 perspektyw\u0119, P\u00e1lfi opowiada o uniwersalnych warto\u015bciach \u2013 wolno\u015bci, bezpiecze\u0144stwie, macierzy\u0144stwie \u2013 jakich poszukuj\u0105 jak wida\u0107 nie tylko ludzie. W\u0119gierski re\u017cyser odwa\u017cnie \u0142\u0105czy filmowe gatunki, tworz\u0105c histori\u0119, kt\u00f3ra z jednej strony mo\u017ce nas bawi\u0107, a z drugiej jest prawdziwie poruszaj\u0105ca.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/L78WO1p_xnA?si=GsO3moP7sAFn8x5D\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D10792","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786965128.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60109":{"id":60109,"title":"Mistyczka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/mistyczka-2026-09-25-15-15-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","date":"2026-09-27T15:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 14:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 15:15:00"},"products":[{"id":29,"name":"bilet normalny 29","rawPrice":2900,"price":"29,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3059,"name":"Mistyczka ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to poruszaj\u0105ca, inspirowana prawdziwymi wydarzeniami historia kobiety, kt\u00f3ra odwa\u017cy\u0142a si\u0119 p\u00f3j\u015b\u0107 za g\u0142osem serca i przekroczy\u0107 granic\u0119 tego, co znane. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o wewn\u0119trznej przemianie, poszukiwaniu sensu egzystencji i niezwyk\u0142ej drodze, kt\u00f3ra zaprowadzi\u0142a Alicj\u0119 Lenczewsk\u0105 do do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 wykraczaj\u0105cych poza materialn\u0105 rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Przez lata Alicja Lenczewska prowadzi\u0142a dynamiczne \u017cycie. By\u0142a wiernym cz\u0142onkiem partii komunistycznej i cenion\u0105 nauczycielk\u0105 \u2013 wymagaj\u0105c\u0105, odpowiedzialn\u0105 i ca\u0142kowicie oddan\u0105 swojej pracy. Uwielbia\u0142a zagraniczne podr\u00f3\u017ce. Wydawa\u0142o si\u0119, \u017ce jej przysz\u0142o\u015b\u0107 zosta\u0142a ju\u017c dawno napisana. A\u017c do dnia, w kt\u00f3rym jedno spotkanie odmieni\u0142o wszystko\u2026<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wbrew sceptycyzmowi otoczenia i w\u0142asnym l\u0119kom Alicja wkracza na \u015bcie\u017ck\u0119 g\u0142\u0119bokiego \u017cycia duchowego. Jej mistyczne zapiski pe\u0142ne szczero\u015bci, nadziei i m\u0105dro\u015bci z czasem trafiaj\u0105 do tysi\u0119cy ludzi szukaj\u0105cych odpowiedzi na najwa\u017cniejsze pytania o mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107, cierpienie, wiar\u0119 i sens \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to film, kt\u00f3ry porusza serce i sk\u0142ania do refleksji. Intymny portret niezwyk\u0142ej kobiety splata si\u0119 tu z uniwersaln\u0105 opowie\u015bci\u0105 o samotno\u015bci, odwadze i potrzebie odnalezienia \u015bwiat\u0142a nawet w najtrudniejszych momentach \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W roli Alicji Lenczewskiej wyst\u0119puje Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, tworz\u0105c jedn\u0105 z najbardziej poruszaj\u0105cych i dojrza\u0142ych kreacji w swojej karierze.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017c.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Jan Sobierajski<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">obsada&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Rados\u0142aw Pazura, Rafa\u0142 Sza\u0142ajko, Marcin Kwa\u015bny, Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, S\u0142awomir Orzechowski, Dariusz Kowalski, Filip Gur\u0142acz<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/oQiqr0HaqLA?si=lQmbZcfw6CEuHFPd\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60044":{"id":60044,"title":"Orlando ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/orlando-2026-09-25-16-45-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3050\/1789035126.jpg","date":"2026-09-27T16:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 16:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 16:45:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3050,"name":"Orlando ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W roku 1600 Orlando, m\u0142odzieniec z arystokratycznego rodu (Tilda Swinton), zostaje obrzucony kl\u0105tw\u0105 \"bycia m\u0142odym na wieki\" przez oczarowan\u0105 jego urod\u0105 kr\u00f3low\u0105 El\u017cbiet\u0119 I. 200 lat p\u00f3\u017aniej zostaje kobiet\u0105, kt\u00f3rej losy \u015bledzimy a\u017c po lata nam wsp\u00f3lczesne. Ubrana w pi\u0119kne obrazy lekko ironiczna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu w\u0142asnej to\u017csamo\u015bci. Film powsta\u0142 na podstawie powie\u015bci Virginii Wolf.<\/span><\/font><div><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017cyseria<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t<\/span>Sally Potter<\/span><\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Scenariusz Sally Potter<\/span><\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Obsada&nbsp;<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t<\/span>Tilda Swinton, Quentin Crisp, John Bott, Elaine Banham, Anna Farnworth<\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/div><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/SbT1KRbOn7o?si=a1OJGVu5KQsn5Tig\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"1992T2D454","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3050\/1789035126.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60102":{"id":60102,"title":"Wind\u0105 na szafot ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/winda-na-szafot-2026-09-26-17-00-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3056\/1789989931.jpg","date":"2026-09-27T17:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 16:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 17:00:00"},"products":[{"id":29,"name":"bilet normalny 29","rawPrice":2900,"price":"29,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3056,"name":"Wind\u0105 na szafot ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Pary\u017c w rytmie jazzu, zbrodnia w rytmie serca.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eWind\u0105 na szafot\u201d (Ascenseur pour l\u2019\u00e9chafaud) z 1958 roku to nie tylko debiut fabularny Louisa Malle\u2019a, ale kamie\u0144 milowy, kt\u00f3ry przetar\u0142 szlaki dla francuskiej Nowej Fali. Legendarne dzie\u0142o niepokornego tw\u00f3rcy znad Sekwany to stylowy krymina\u0142 noir, w kt\u00f3rym melancholijna atmosfera paryskich ulic by\u0107 mo\u017ce jest nawet wa\u017cniejsza od fabularnej intrygi. W centrum historii jest zbrodnia pope\u0142niona przez Juliana Taverniera na m\u0119\u017cu swojej kochanki. Mo\u017ce to morderstwo by\u0142oby doskona\u0142e, gdyby nie \u201edrobny\u201d szczeg\u00f3\u0142, kt\u00f3ry powoduje, \u017ce Julian musi wr\u00f3ci\u0107 na miejsce zbrodni.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eWind\u0105 na szafot\u201d to przede wszystkim nastrojowe kino osi\u0105gni\u0119te pionierskim zastosowaniem ma\u0142ych kamer, swobodn\u0105 konstrukcj\u0105, pi\u0119knymi zdj\u0119ciami i niezapomnian\u0105, stworzon\u0105 w ci\u0105gu doby, legendarn\u0105 muzyk\u0105 geniusza jazzu \u2013 Milesa Daviesa. To tak\u017ce pierwszy film w kt\u00f3rym mog\u0142a ods\u0142oni\u0107 sw\u00f3j talent przysz\u0142a ikona francuskiego kina \u2013 Jeanne Moreau.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Francja 1957, 91\u2019<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><div style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Re\u017cyseria: Louis Malle<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Muzyka: Miles Davis<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Scenariusz: Roger Nimier, Louis Malle (oparty na powie\u015bci Noela Calefa \u201eWind\u0105 na szafot\u201d)<\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Jeanne Moreau, Maurice Ronet, Georges Poujouly, Yori Bertin<\/span><\/div><\/font><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3056\/1789989931.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60051":{"id":60051,"title":"Birthday Party ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/birthday-party-2026-09-25-18-30-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1790073908.jpg","date":"2026-09-27T18:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 18:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 18:30:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3057,"name":"Birthday Party ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wp\u0142ywowy grecki magnat \u015bwi\u0119tuje 25. urodziny c\u00f3rki na prywatnej wyspie otoczony gronem najpot\u0119\u017cniejszych ludzi \u015bwiata. W miar\u0119 rozwoju przyj\u0119cia na jaw zaczynaj\u0105 wychodzi\u0107 mroczne sekrety zebranych.<\/span><\/font><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017c. Miguel \u00c1ngel Jim\u00e9nez<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">obsada&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t<\/span>Willem Dafoe, Vic Carmen Sonne, Joe Cole<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div style=\"\">produkcja: Grecja, Hiszpania, Holandia, Wielka Brytania 2026<\/div><div style=\"\">j\u0119zyk: angielski<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/q66_3aPe6OA?si=5QPi75GoE7XsBJG6\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1790073908.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60117":{"id":60117,"title":"Obcy ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/obcy-2026-09-25-18-45-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","date":"2026-09-27T18:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 18:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 18:45:00"},"products":[{"id":29,"name":"bilet normalny 29","rawPrice":2900,"price":"29,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3022,"name":"Obcy ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d w re\u017cyserii Fran\u00e7ois Ozona to nowa ekranizacja jednej z najwybitniejszych francuskich powie\u015bci XX wieku autorstwa Alberta Camusa. Prezentowana w Konkursie G\u0142\u00f3wnym festiwalu w Wenecji&nbsp; to wci\u0105\u017c niezwykle aktualna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu sensu w \u015bwiecie, w kt\u00f3rym wszelki sens zosta\u0142 zagubiony.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d jest histori\u0105 Meursaulta, m\u0142odego m\u0119\u017cczyzny, skromnego urz\u0119dnika, kt\u00f3rego codziennej rutyny nie przerywa nawet \u015bmier\u0107 matki. Wszystko zmienia si\u0119 pewnego gor\u0105cego dnia, gdy na pla\u017cy dochodzi do tragicznego zdarzenia z jego udzia\u0142em.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Oszcz\u0119dne dialogi i pi\u0119kne czarno-bia\u0142e zdj\u0119cia, b\u0119d\u0105ce ho\u0142dem dla klasycznego kina, buduj\u0105 wyj\u0105tkow\u0105 atmosfer\u0119 filmu.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Re\u017cyseria: Fran\u00e7ois Ozon<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Benjamin Voisin, Rebecca Marder, Pierre Lottin, Denis Lavant, Swann Arlaud<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Francja 2025, 122'<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/b2yaQbsNAk0?si=m6suXUoNcKv7bWOG\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D10184","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60037":{"id":60037,"title":"Requiem dla snu  ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/requiem-dla-snu-2026-09-25-20-30-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/2997\/1784032934.jpg","date":"2026-09-27T20:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 20:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2997,"name":"Requiem dla snu  ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to drugi pe\u0142nometra\u017cowy film Darrena Aronofsky\u2019ego, na podstawie powie\u015bci legendarnego ameryka\u0144skiego pisarza, Huberta Selby\u2019ego Jr. \u0106wier\u0107 wieku temu trafi\u0142 do Polski dzi\u0119ki dystrybucji Gutek Film i wry\u0142 si\u0119 w nasz\u0105 popkultur\u0119 tak g\u0142\u0119boko, \u017ce sta\u0142 si\u0119 niezwykle wa\u017cnym tekstem kultury, cytowanym przez pisarzy, tw\u00f3rc\u00f3w teatralnych i raper\u00f3w. M\u0142odzi wtedy aktorzy - Jared Leto, Jennifer Connelly i Marlon Wayans - z dnia na dzie\u0144 trafili na hollywoodzki szczyt, hipnotyzuj\u0105cy popis Ellen Burstyn przyni\u00f3s\u0142 jej nominacj\u0119 do Oscara, a sam re\u017cyser udowodni\u0142, \u017ce jest wizjonerem kina. Teraz, po 25 latach od premiery, film powraca do kin w odrestaurowanej wersji 4K. <br><br>\u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to wstrz\u0105saj\u0105ca opowie\u015b\u0107 o czw\u00f3rce bohater\u00f3w z Brooklynu, kt\u00f3rzy w pogoni za realizacj\u0105 swoich marze\u0144 odbywaj\u0105 podr\u00f3\u017c w g\u0142\u0105b piek\u0142a uzale\u017cnie\u0144. Dla rozprowadzaj\u0105cego narkotyki Harry'ego (Leto), jego uzale\u017cnionej od pigu\u0142ek na odchudzanie matki (Burstyn), pogr\u0105\u017conej w na\u0142ogu dziewczyny (Connelly) i najlepszego przyjaciela (Wayans) ucieczka od rzeczywisto\u015bci ko\u0144czy si\u0119 tragedi\u0105. Nie mog\u0105c sobie poradzi\u0107 z chaosem otaczaj\u0105cego ich wsp\u00f3\u0142czesnego \u015bwiata, ka\u017cde z nich popada w uzale\u017cnienie - od narkotyk\u00f3w, s\u0142odyczy lub telewizji.&nbsp; \u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to hipnotyczna opowie\u015b\u0107 o t\u0119sknocie za mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105, \u017cyciu w iluzji i k\u0142amstwie oraz o pu\u0142apce na\u0142ogu. <br><br>Ekranowego dramatu bohater\u00f3w dope\u0142nia genialny, \u015bwidruj\u0105cy m\u00f3zg soundtrack Clinta Mansella w wykonaniu Kronos Quartet. Motyw Lux Aeterna to muzyczny klasyk, po dzi\u015b dzie\u0144 bezlito\u015bnie przerabiany i samplowany. A samo \u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d, ogl\u0105dane po latach, wci\u0105\u017c funduje widzom szokuj\u0105cy, emocjonalny rollercoaster, po kt\u00f3rym trudno doj\u015b\u0107 do siebie.<\/span><\/font>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2001T2D135","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/2997\/1784032934.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60122":{"id":60122,"title":"Martwe z\u0142o 2 ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/martwe-zlo-2-2026-09-25-21-00-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3060\/1790077975.jpg","date":"2026-09-27T21:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":121,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 20:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 21:00:00"},"products":[{"id":29,"name":"bilet normalny 29","rawPrice":2900,"price":"29,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":121}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3060,"name":"Martwe z\u0142o 2 ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Ash Williams (Bruce Campbell) zabiera dziewczyn\u0119 do odludnej chaty w lesie na romantyczny weekend. Na miejscu znajduje magnetofon z nagraniem inkantacji z Necronomiconu, Ksi\u0119gi Umar\u0142ych \u2013 i naciska \u201eplay\u201d. To b\u0142\u0105d. Demony budz\u0105 si\u0119 natychmiast, dziewczyna zmienia si\u0119 w rozchichotane truch\u0142o, a sam Ash rozpoczyna najd\u0142u\u017csz\u0105 noc swojego \u017cycia: noc, podczas kt\u00f3rej jego w\u0142asna d\u0142o\u0144 zwr\u00f3ci si\u0119 przeciwko niemu, meble wybuchn\u0105 zbiorowym \u015bmiechem, a jedynym rozs\u0105dnym rozwi\u0105zaniem oka\u017ce si\u0119 pi\u0142a mechaniczna zamontowana na kikucie.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eMartwe z\u0142o 2\u201d Sama Raimiego to jeden z najzabawniejszych paradoks\u00f3w historii kina: sequel, kt\u00f3ry jest jednocze\u015bnie remakiem, parodi\u0105 i przelicytowaniem orygina\u0142u \u2013 i kt\u00f3ry zdefiniowa\u0142 gatunek splatstick, czyli slapstick zanurzony po \u0142okcie w hektolitrach posoki. Raimi, dysponuj\u0105c wreszcie porz\u0105dnym bud\u017cetem, przekszta\u0142ci\u0142 surowy horror swojego debiutu w kresk\u00f3wk\u0119 na \u017cywo: kamera szar\u017cuje przez las jak op\u0119tana (s\u0142ynne uj\u0119cia \u201ez perspektywy z\u0142a\u201d kr\u0119cono, przywi\u0105zuj\u0105c kamer\u0119 do deski niesionej przez biegn\u0105cych operator\u00f3w), scenografia jest wsp\u00f3\u0142sprawc\u0105 przemocy, a groza i groteska przestaj\u0105 by\u0107 przeciwie\u0144stwami, zlewaj\u0105c si\u0119 w jeden rozp\u0119dzony \u017cywio\u0142.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Ale prawdziwym cudem filmu jest Bruce Campbell. Jego Ash to arcydzie\u0142o fizycznej komedii: cz\u0142owiek ok\u0142adany przez ca\u0142y wszech\u015bwiat (w tym przez samego siebie \u2013 walka z w\u0142asn\u0105 r\u0119k\u0105 to pi\u0119\u0107 minut czystego geniuszu), kt\u00f3ry z ofiary przepoczwarza si\u0119 w przerysowanego macho. Kreacja ta uczyni\u0142a z Campbella wiecznego kr\u00f3la kina klasy B, a z Asha \u2013 jednego z najukocha\u0144szych bohater\u00f3w popkultury. W 4K ka\u017cda kropla sztucznej krwi (a s\u0105 jej tysi\u0105ce) l\u015bni jak nowa. [Grzegorz Fortuna<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div>Re\u017cyseria: Sam Raimi | Produkcja: USA, 1987 | Czas: 84'<\/div><div>Wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Bruce Campbell, Sarah Berry, Dan Hicks<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3060\/1790077975.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60073":{"id":60073,"title":"Marsupilami- dubbing ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/marsupilami-dubbing-2026-09-28-12-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3058\/1790074848.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T12:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 11:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 12:00:00"},"products":[{"id":119,"name":"Bilet tani pon.","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3058,"name":"Marsupilami- dubbing ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Szalona, pe\u0142na humoru przygoda, w kt\u00f3rej w centrum akcji znajduje si\u0119 prawdziwy psotnik \u2013 tajemnicze stworzenie MARSUPILAMI! W polskiej wersji j\u0119zykowej us\u0142yszymy plejad\u0119 gwiazd: Cezarego Pazur\u0119, Magdalen\u0119 Boczarsk\u0105, Mateusza Banasiuka i Tomasza O\u015bwieci\u0144skiego. Podczas rejsu all-inclusive David, Tess i ich synek odkrywaj\u0105 w swoim baga\u017cu uroczego, \u017c\u00f3\u0142tego stworka w czarne c\u0119tki, kt\u00f3rego niewyobra\u017calnie d\u0142ugi ogon i nieposkromiony temperament w mgnieniu oka zamieniaj\u0105 rodzinne wakacje w totalny chaos \u2013 zw\u0142aszcza gdy okazuje si\u0119, \u017ce nowego przyjaciela ch\u0142opca pr\u00f3buje odnale\u017a\u0107 zdecydowanie zbyt wiele os\u00f3b!<\/span><\/font><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div style=\"\">Francja, Belgia 2025<\/div><div style=\"\">czas: 98\u2019<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/7aufdriIfNs?si=NA3F_J2cGcsSBBYS\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3058\/1790074848.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60105":{"id":60105,"title":"Tony ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/tony-2026-09-28-13-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788189036.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T13:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 12:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 13:15:00"},"products":[{"id":119,"name":"Bilet tani pon.","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3046,"name":"Tony ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Anthony Bourdain \u2013 buntownik, outsider, g\u0142os pokolenia, jeden z najbardziej znanych szef\u00f3w kuchni i jedna z najwi\u0119kszych, najbardziej charyzmatycznych osobowo\u015bci telewizyjnych. Podr\u00f3\u017cnik, pisarz, odkrywca, kt\u00f3rego miliony ludzi na ca\u0142ym \u015bwiecie pokocha\u0142y za bezkompromisowy styl, mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107 do \u017cycia, szacunek do ludzi, odwag\u0119, ciekawo\u015b\u0107 \u015bwiata i autentyczno\u015b\u0107. TONY to historia pocz\u0105tk\u00f3w jego drogi \u2013 kim by\u0142, zanim sta\u0142 si\u0119 Anthonym Bourdainem.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Upalne lato 1976 roku, Provincetown \u2013 miasto pulsuj\u0105ce wolno\u015bci\u0105, seksem i energi\u0105. M\u0142ody, marz\u0105cy o karierze pisarza, Tony (Dominic Sessa), by podreperowa\u0107 bud\u017cet, trafia na zmywak do restauracji serwuj\u0105cej owoce morza, prowadzonej przez tajemniczego szefa kuchni (Antonio Banderas). W intensywnej, chaotycznej, a jednocze\u015bnie niezwykle kreatywnej atmosferze Tony odkrywa swoj\u0105 pasj\u0119, powo\u0142anie i to, kim tak naprawd\u0119 jest.<br><br><br>CZAS TRWANIA: 106 min.<br><br><br><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/uI88YvjFdgE?si=Phxn31Jy5UORGEXA\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T2D4342","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788189036.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60066":{"id":60066,"title":"Kumotry ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kumotry-2026-09-28-13-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1780645915.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T13:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 13:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 13:30:00"},"products":[{"id":119,"name":"Bilet tani pon.","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2975,"name":"Kumotry ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Pustoszej\u0105ca polska wie\u015b w rumu\u0144skich Karpatach: wzruszaj\u0105cy film o pami\u0119ci, przyja\u017ani i przemijaniu. <br><br>Historia przyja\u017ani kobiet zamieszkuj\u0105cych wymieraj\u0105c\u0105 polsk\u0105 wie\u015b w rumu\u0144skich Karpatach. Hanka i Bronka pochowa\u0142y ju\u017c m\u0119\u017c\u00f3w, dzieci wyjecha\u0142y za granic\u0119 w poszukiwaniu innych, lepszych perspektyw. Samodzielne i niezale\u017cne bohaterki imponuj\u0105 pogod\u0105 ducha, cho\u0107 ich rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107 nieub\u0142aganie odchodzi w przesz\u0142o\u015b\u0107. Pozostaj\u0105 wspomnienia o czasach, kt\u00f3re ju\u017c nie wr\u00f3c\u0105 \u2013 i wsp\u00f3lne stawianie czo\u0142a wyzwaniom codzienno\u015bci. Nostalgiczny obraz nikn\u0105cego \u015bwiata skrzy si\u0119 bezpretensjonalnym humorem i zachwyca zdj\u0119ciami, oddaj\u0105cymi zniewalaj\u0105cy urok karpackiego pog\u00f3rza. Zwracaj\u0105c uwag\u0119 na szczeg\u00f3\u0142y, re\u017cyserka tworzy wzruszaj\u0105cy film o pami\u0119ci, przyja\u017ani i przemijaniu. Pokazuj\u0105c ludzi, kt\u00f3rzy potrafi\u0105 by\u0107 dla siebie wszystkim, sk\u0142ania nas do przewarto\u015bciowania priorytet\u00f3w i spojrzenia na rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107 z mniej ucz\u0119szczanej strony.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/WWeJxcoEvH0?si=MeApd5ksdM9Q6oq4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D6143","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1780645915.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60080":{"id":60080,"title":"Gorzkie \u015bwi\u0119ta ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/gorzkie-swieta-2026-09-28-13-45","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3003\/1784016423.png","date":"2026-09-28T13:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 13:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 13:45:00"},"products":[{"id":119,"name":"Bilet tani pon.","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3003,"name":"Gorzkie \u015bwi\u0119ta ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Pedro Almod\u00f3var powraca w szczytowej formie z jednym ze swoich najbardziej osobistych film\u00f3w. W \u201eGorzkich \u015bwi\u0119tach\u201d - jego pierwszej od 5 lat hiszpa\u0144skoj\u0119zycznej produkcji - jest wszystko, za co widzowie kochaj\u0105 jego kino: nami\u0119tno\u015b\u0107, intensywne kolory, przewrotny humor i pe\u0142nokrwiste postaci, kt\u00f3re wymykaj\u0105 si\u0119 prostym schematom. Na ekranie pojawiaj\u0105 si\u0119 aktorzy i aktorki znani z wcze\u015bniejszych film\u00f3w re\u017cysera: B\u00e1rbara Lennie, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Victoria Luengo, Aitana S\u00e1nchez-Gij\u00f3n, Milena Smit oraz jedna z najwa\u017cniejszych muz Almod\u00f3vara \u2013 Rossy de Palma. <br><br>Bohaterk\u0105 filmu jest czterdziestoletnia Elza (B\u00e1rbara Lennie), kt\u00f3ra po \u015bmierci matki rzuca si\u0119 w wir pracy, nie pozwalaj\u0105c sobie na \u017ca\u0142ob\u0119. Dopiero atak paniki zmusza j\u0105 do zatrzymania si\u0119 i wyruszenia w podr\u00f3\u017c, kt\u00f3ra stanie si\u0119 konfrontacj\u0105 z przesz\u0142o\u015bci\u0105, utraconymi relacjami i niespe\u0142nionymi pragnieniami. Z przypadkowych spotka\u0144, emocjonalnych zwrot\u00f3w i splataj\u0105cych si\u0119 \u017cyciorys\u00f3w Almod\u00f3var tka opowie\u015b\u0107 o tym, jak pami\u0119\u0107, fikcja i pragnienie nieustannie przepisuj\u0105 nasze \u017cycie. <br><br>\u201eGorzkie \u015bwi\u0119ta\u201d to szczeg\u00f3lny prezent dla tych, kt\u00f3rzy dorastali z kinem hiszpa\u0144skiego mistrza \u2013 od \u201eKobiet na skraju za\u0142amania nerwowego\u201d, przez \u201eWszystko o mojej matce\u201d i \u201ePorozmawiaj z ni\u0105\u201d, po \u201eVolver\u201d, \u201ePrzerwane obj\u0119cia\u201d i \u201eB\u00f3l i blask\u201d. To tak\u017ce film, kt\u00f3ry idzie o krok dalej: jeszcze mocniej pokazuje, \u017ce ka\u017cdy z nas nie tylko prze\u017cywa w\u0142asn\u0105 histori\u0119, ale te\u017c bez ko\u0144ca j\u0105 sobie opowiada. Almod\u00f3var sk\u0142ada tu poruszaj\u0105ce wyznanie wiary w si\u0142\u0119 kina, pami\u0119ci i narracji.<\/span><br><br><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div style=\"\">re\u017cyseria: Pedro Almod\u00f3var<\/div><div style=\"\">aktorzy: B\u00e1rbara Lennie, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Aitana S\u00e1nchez-Gij\u00f3n, Victoria Luengo, Patrick Criado, Milena Smit, Quim Guti\u00e9rrez, Rossy de Palma, Carmen Machi<\/div><div style=\"\">Hiszpania 2026,111'<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/Nz7UX762UoA?si=qTp0m6qAgt8LR01B\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T2D4118","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3003\/1784016423.png","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60059":{"id":60059,"title":"Kura ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kura-2026-09-28-15-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786965128.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T15:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 14:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 15:00:00"},"products":[{"id":119,"name":"Bilet tani pon.","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3030,"name":"Kura ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">G\u0142\u00f3wn\u0105 bohaterk\u0105 nowego filmu w\u0119gierskiego re\u017cysera Gy\u00f6rgya P\u00e1lfiego jest tytu\u0142owa kura. Pozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.<br><br>Trafia do greckiej nadmorskiej wioski, gdzie schwytana zostaje przez w\u0142a\u015bciciela podupad\u0142ej restauracji i si\u0142\u0105 rzeczy \u201ewchodzi\u201d do ludzkiego \u015bwiata. Jest uwa\u017cn\u0105 obserwatork\u0105 zupe\u0142nie obcej dla niej rzeczywisto\u015bci. Staje si\u0119 te\u017c niemym \u015bwiadkiem ludzkich dramat\u00f3w, zwi\u0105zanych z kryzysem migracyjnym, rodzinnymi konfliktami czy chciwo\u015bci\u0105. <br><br>W rol\u0119 g\u0142\u00f3wnej bohaterki wcieli\u0142o si\u0119 osiem prawdziwych w\u0119gierskich kur: Eszti, Szandi, Feri, Enci, Eti, Enik\u0151, N\u00f3ra i Anett. <br><br>Przyjmuj\u0105c nieoczywist\u0105 perspektyw\u0119, P\u00e1lfi opowiada o uniwersalnych warto\u015bciach \u2013 wolno\u015bci, bezpiecze\u0144stwie, macierzy\u0144stwie \u2013 jakich poszukuj\u0105 jak wida\u0107 nie tylko ludzie. W\u0119gierski re\u017cyser odwa\u017cnie \u0142\u0105czy filmowe gatunki, tworz\u0105c histori\u0119, kt\u00f3ra z jednej strony mo\u017ce nas bawi\u0107, a z drugiej jest prawdziwie poruszaj\u0105ca.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/L78WO1p_xnA?si=GsO3moP7sAFn8x5D\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D10792","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786965128.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60110":{"id":60110,"title":"Mistyczka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/mistyczka-2026-09-28-15-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T15:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 14:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 15:15:00"},"products":[{"id":119,"name":"Bilet tani pon.","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3059,"name":"Mistyczka ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to poruszaj\u0105ca, inspirowana prawdziwymi wydarzeniami historia kobiety, kt\u00f3ra odwa\u017cy\u0142a si\u0119 p\u00f3j\u015b\u0107 za g\u0142osem serca i przekroczy\u0107 granic\u0119 tego, co znane. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o wewn\u0119trznej przemianie, poszukiwaniu sensu egzystencji i niezwyk\u0142ej drodze, kt\u00f3ra zaprowadzi\u0142a Alicj\u0119 Lenczewsk\u0105 do do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 wykraczaj\u0105cych poza materialn\u0105 rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Przez lata Alicja Lenczewska prowadzi\u0142a dynamiczne \u017cycie. By\u0142a wiernym cz\u0142onkiem partii komunistycznej i cenion\u0105 nauczycielk\u0105 \u2013 wymagaj\u0105c\u0105, odpowiedzialn\u0105 i ca\u0142kowicie oddan\u0105 swojej pracy. Uwielbia\u0142a zagraniczne podr\u00f3\u017ce. Wydawa\u0142o si\u0119, \u017ce jej przysz\u0142o\u015b\u0107 zosta\u0142a ju\u017c dawno napisana. A\u017c do dnia, w kt\u00f3rym jedno spotkanie odmieni\u0142o wszystko\u2026<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wbrew sceptycyzmowi otoczenia i w\u0142asnym l\u0119kom Alicja wkracza na \u015bcie\u017ck\u0119 g\u0142\u0119bokiego \u017cycia duchowego. Jej mistyczne zapiski pe\u0142ne szczero\u015bci, nadziei i m\u0105dro\u015bci z czasem trafiaj\u0105 do tysi\u0119cy ludzi szukaj\u0105cych odpowiedzi na najwa\u017cniejsze pytania o mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107, cierpienie, wiar\u0119 i sens \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to film, kt\u00f3ry porusza serce i sk\u0142ania do refleksji. Intymny portret niezwyk\u0142ej kobiety splata si\u0119 tu z uniwersaln\u0105 opowie\u015bci\u0105 o samotno\u015bci, odwadze i potrzebie odnalezienia \u015bwiat\u0142a nawet w najtrudniejszych momentach \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W roli Alicji Lenczewskiej wyst\u0119puje Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, tworz\u0105c jedn\u0105 z najbardziej poruszaj\u0105cych i dojrza\u0142ych kreacji w swojej karierze.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017c.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Jan Sobierajski<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">obsada&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Rados\u0142aw Pazura, Rafa\u0142 Sza\u0142ajko, Marcin Kwa\u015bny, Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, S\u0142awomir Orzechowski, Dariusz Kowalski, Filip Gur\u0142acz<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/oQiqr0HaqLA?si=lQmbZcfw6CEuHFPd\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60085":{"id":60085,"title":"Obcy ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/obcy-2026-09-28-15-45","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","date":"2026-09-28T15:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 15:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 15:45:00"},"products":[{"id":119,"name":"Bilet tani pon.","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3022,"name":"Obcy ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d w re\u017cyserii Fran\u00e7ois Ozona to nowa ekranizacja jednej z najwybitniejszych francuskich powie\u015bci XX wieku autorstwa Alberta Camusa. Prezentowana w Konkursie G\u0142\u00f3wnym festiwalu w Wenecji&nbsp; to wci\u0105\u017c niezwykle aktualna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu sensu w \u015bwiecie, w kt\u00f3rym wszelki sens zosta\u0142 zagubiony.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d jest histori\u0105 Meursaulta, m\u0142odego m\u0119\u017cczyzny, skromnego urz\u0119dnika, kt\u00f3rego codziennej rutyny nie przerywa nawet \u015bmier\u0107 matki. Wszystko zmienia si\u0119 pewnego gor\u0105cego dnia, gdy na pla\u017cy dochodzi do tragicznego zdarzenia z jego udzia\u0142em.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Oszcz\u0119dne dialogi i pi\u0119kne czarno-bia\u0142e zdj\u0119cia, b\u0119d\u0105ce ho\u0142dem dla klasycznego kina, buduj\u0105 wyj\u0105tkow\u0105 atmosfer\u0119 filmu.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Re\u017cyseria: Fran\u00e7ois Ozon<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Benjamin Voisin, Rebecca Marder, Pierre Lottin, Denis Lavant, Swann Arlaud<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Francja 2025, 122'<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/b2yaQbsNAk0?si=m6suXUoNcKv7bWOG\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D10184","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60045":{"id":60045,"title":"Orlando ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/orlando-2026-09-28-16-45","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3050\/1789035126.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T16:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 16:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 16:45:00"},"products":[{"id":119,"name":"Bilet tani pon.","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3050,"name":"Orlando ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W roku 1600 Orlando, m\u0142odzieniec z arystokratycznego rodu (Tilda Swinton), zostaje obrzucony kl\u0105tw\u0105 \"bycia m\u0142odym na wieki\" przez oczarowan\u0105 jego urod\u0105 kr\u00f3low\u0105 El\u017cbiet\u0119 I. 200 lat p\u00f3\u017aniej zostaje kobiet\u0105, kt\u00f3rej losy \u015bledzimy a\u017c po lata nam wsp\u00f3lczesne. Ubrana w pi\u0119kne obrazy lekko ironiczna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu w\u0142asnej to\u017csamo\u015bci. Film powsta\u0142 na podstawie powie\u015bci Virginii Wolf.<\/span><\/font><div><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017cyseria<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t<\/span>Sally Potter<\/span><\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Scenariusz Sally Potter<\/span><\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Obsada&nbsp;<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t<\/span>Tilda Swinton, Quentin Crisp, John Bott, Elaine Banham, Anna Farnworth<\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/div><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/SbT1KRbOn7o?si=a1OJGVu5KQsn5Tig\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"1992T2D454","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3050\/1789035126.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60113":{"id":60113,"title":"Powiedz mi, co czujesz ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/powiedz-mi-co-czujesz-2026-09-28-17-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789035367.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T17:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 16:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 17:00:00"},"products":[{"id":119,"name":"Bilet tani pon.","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3051,"name":"Powiedz mi, co czujesz ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201ePowiedz mi, co czujesz\u201d to subtelna opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142o\u015bci dwojga m\u0142odych artyst\u00f3w, dla kt\u00f3rych pierwszy powa\u017cny zwi\u0105zek w doros\u0142ym \u017cyciu staje si\u0119 lustrem ich dawnych do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 i blizn. W rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych wyst\u0119puj\u0105 obiecuj\u0105cy aktorzy m\u0142odego pokolenia: Jan Sa\u0142asi\u0144ski, Izabella Dudziak oraz Sebastian Dela. Film jest inspirowany \u017cyciem i tw\u00f3rczo\u015bci\u0105 Patryka R\u00f3\u017cyckiego oraz Karoliny Balcer i projektem artystycznym \u201eSkup \u0141ez\u201d Alicji Rogalskiej i \u0141ukasza Surowca. <br><br>Bohaterowie maj\u0105 po dwadzie\u015bcia lat. Ona tworzy nietypowy projekt SKUP \u0141EZ, w kt\u00f3rym p\u0142aci ludziom za ich\u2026 \u0142zy. On - pocz\u0105tkuj\u0105cy artysta - nie potrafi p\u0142aka\u0107. Ich uczucie rozwija si\u0119 intensywnie i szybko, otwieraj\u0105c drog\u0119 do g\u0142\u0119bokiej przemiany, kt\u00f3ra oka\u017ce si\u0119 jednym z najwa\u017cniejszych do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 w ich \u017cyciu. \u201ePowiedz mi, co czujesz\u201d to poruszaj\u0105ca historia o intymnej blisko\u015bci i mi\u0142o\u015bci, kt\u00f3ra potrafi by\u0107 najlepszym terapeut\u0105.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/-gi8nuA6FRY?si=JywVNH1jU8tD5FCD\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T3D4311","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789035367.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60097":{"id":60097,"title":"Mistyczka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/mistyczka-2026-09-28-18-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T18:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 17:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 18:00:00"},"products":[{"id":119,"name":"Bilet tani pon.","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3059,"name":"Mistyczka ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to poruszaj\u0105ca, inspirowana prawdziwymi wydarzeniami historia kobiety, kt\u00f3ra odwa\u017cy\u0142a si\u0119 p\u00f3j\u015b\u0107 za g\u0142osem serca i przekroczy\u0107 granic\u0119 tego, co znane. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o wewn\u0119trznej przemianie, poszukiwaniu sensu egzystencji i niezwyk\u0142ej drodze, kt\u00f3ra zaprowadzi\u0142a Alicj\u0119 Lenczewsk\u0105 do do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 wykraczaj\u0105cych poza materialn\u0105 rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Przez lata Alicja Lenczewska prowadzi\u0142a dynamiczne \u017cycie. By\u0142a wiernym cz\u0142onkiem partii komunistycznej i cenion\u0105 nauczycielk\u0105 \u2013 wymagaj\u0105c\u0105, odpowiedzialn\u0105 i ca\u0142kowicie oddan\u0105 swojej pracy. Uwielbia\u0142a zagraniczne podr\u00f3\u017ce. Wydawa\u0142o si\u0119, \u017ce jej przysz\u0142o\u015b\u0107 zosta\u0142a ju\u017c dawno napisana. A\u017c do dnia, w kt\u00f3rym jedno spotkanie odmieni\u0142o wszystko\u2026<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wbrew sceptycyzmowi otoczenia i w\u0142asnym l\u0119kom Alicja wkracza na \u015bcie\u017ck\u0119 g\u0142\u0119bokiego \u017cycia duchowego. Jej mistyczne zapiski pe\u0142ne szczero\u015bci, nadziei i m\u0105dro\u015bci z czasem trafiaj\u0105 do tysi\u0119cy ludzi szukaj\u0105cych odpowiedzi na najwa\u017cniejsze pytania o mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107, cierpienie, wiar\u0119 i sens \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to film, kt\u00f3ry porusza serce i sk\u0142ania do refleksji. Intymny portret niezwyk\u0142ej kobiety splata si\u0119 tu z uniwersaln\u0105 opowie\u015bci\u0105 o samotno\u015bci, odwadze i potrzebie odnalezienia \u015bwiat\u0142a nawet w najtrudniejszych momentach \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W roli Alicji Lenczewskiej wyst\u0119puje Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, tworz\u0105c jedn\u0105 z najbardziej poruszaj\u0105cych i dojrza\u0142ych kreacji w swojej karierze.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017c.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Jan Sobierajski<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">obsada&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Rados\u0142aw Pazura, Rafa\u0142 Sza\u0142ajko, Marcin Kwa\u015bny, Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, S\u0142awomir Orzechowski, Dariusz Kowalski, Filip Gur\u0142acz<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/oQiqr0HaqLA?si=lQmbZcfw6CEuHFPd\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60052":{"id":60052,"title":"Birthday Party ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/birthday-party-2026-09-28-18-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1790073908.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T18:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 18:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 18:30:00"},"products":[{"id":119,"name":"Bilet tani pon.","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3057,"name":"Birthday Party ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wp\u0142ywowy grecki magnat \u015bwi\u0119tuje 25. urodziny c\u00f3rki na prywatnej wyspie otoczony gronem najpot\u0119\u017cniejszych ludzi \u015bwiata. W miar\u0119 rozwoju przyj\u0119cia na jaw zaczynaj\u0105 wychodzi\u0107 mroczne sekrety zebranych.<\/span><\/font><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017c. Miguel \u00c1ngel Jim\u00e9nez<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">obsada&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t<\/span>Willem Dafoe, Vic Carmen Sonne, Joe Cole<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div style=\"\">produkcja: Grecja, Hiszpania, Holandia, Wielka Brytania 2026<\/div><div style=\"\">j\u0119zyk: angielski<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/q66_3aPe6OA?si=5QPi75GoE7XsBJG6\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1790073908.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60118":{"id":60118,"title":"Obcy ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/obcy-2026-09-28-18-45","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","date":"2026-09-28T18:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":119,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 18:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 18:45:00"},"products":[{"id":119,"name":"Bilet tani pon.","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":119}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3022,"name":"Obcy ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d w re\u017cyserii Fran\u00e7ois Ozona to nowa ekranizacja jednej z najwybitniejszych francuskich powie\u015bci XX wieku autorstwa Alberta Camusa. Prezentowana w Konkursie G\u0142\u00f3wnym festiwalu w Wenecji&nbsp; to wci\u0105\u017c niezwykle aktualna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu sensu w \u015bwiecie, w kt\u00f3rym wszelki sens zosta\u0142 zagubiony.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d jest histori\u0105 Meursaulta, m\u0142odego m\u0119\u017cczyzny, skromnego urz\u0119dnika, kt\u00f3rego codziennej rutyny nie przerywa nawet \u015bmier\u0107 matki. Wszystko zmienia si\u0119 pewnego gor\u0105cego dnia, gdy na pla\u017cy dochodzi do tragicznego zdarzenia z jego udzia\u0142em.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Oszcz\u0119dne dialogi i pi\u0119kne czarno-bia\u0142e zdj\u0119cia, b\u0119d\u0105ce ho\u0142dem dla klasycznego kina, buduj\u0105 wyj\u0105tkow\u0105 atmosfer\u0119 filmu.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Re\u017cyseria: Fran\u00e7ois Ozon<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Benjamin Voisin, Rebecca Marder, Pierre Lottin, Denis Lavant, Swann Arlaud<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Francja 2025, 122'<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/b2yaQbsNAk0?si=m6suXUoNcKv7bWOG\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D10184","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60092":{"id":60092,"title":"Powiedz mi, co czujesz ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/powiedz-mi-co-czujesz-2026-09-28-19-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789035367.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T19:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 19:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 19:30:00"},"products":[{"id":119,"name":"Bilet tani pon.","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3051,"name":"Powiedz mi, co czujesz ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201ePowiedz mi, co czujesz\u201d to subtelna opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142o\u015bci dwojga m\u0142odych artyst\u00f3w, dla kt\u00f3rych pierwszy powa\u017cny zwi\u0105zek w doros\u0142ym \u017cyciu staje si\u0119 lustrem ich dawnych do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 i blizn. W rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych wyst\u0119puj\u0105 obiecuj\u0105cy aktorzy m\u0142odego pokolenia: Jan Sa\u0142asi\u0144ski, Izabella Dudziak oraz Sebastian Dela. Film jest inspirowany \u017cyciem i tw\u00f3rczo\u015bci\u0105 Patryka R\u00f3\u017cyckiego oraz Karoliny Balcer i projektem artystycznym \u201eSkup \u0141ez\u201d Alicji Rogalskiej i \u0141ukasza Surowca. <br><br>Bohaterowie maj\u0105 po dwadzie\u015bcia lat. Ona tworzy nietypowy projekt SKUP \u0141EZ, w kt\u00f3rym p\u0142aci ludziom za ich\u2026 \u0142zy. On - pocz\u0105tkuj\u0105cy artysta - nie potrafi p\u0142aka\u0107. Ich uczucie rozwija si\u0119 intensywnie i szybko, otwieraj\u0105c drog\u0119 do g\u0142\u0119bokiej przemiany, kt\u00f3ra oka\u017ce si\u0119 jednym z najwa\u017cniejszych do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 w ich \u017cyciu. \u201ePowiedz mi, co czujesz\u201d to poruszaj\u0105ca historia o intymnej blisko\u015bci i mi\u0142o\u015bci, kt\u00f3ra potrafi by\u0107 najlepszym terapeut\u0105.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/-gi8nuA6FRY?si=JywVNH1jU8tD5FCD\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T3D4311","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789035367.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60038":{"id":60038,"title":"Requiem dla snu  ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/requiem-dla-snu-2026-09-28-20-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/2997\/1784032934.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T20:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":13,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 20:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":119,"name":"Bilet tani pon.","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":13}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2997,"name":"Requiem dla snu  ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to drugi pe\u0142nometra\u017cowy film Darrena Aronofsky\u2019ego, na podstawie powie\u015bci legendarnego ameryka\u0144skiego pisarza, Huberta Selby\u2019ego Jr. \u0106wier\u0107 wieku temu trafi\u0142 do Polski dzi\u0119ki dystrybucji Gutek Film i wry\u0142 si\u0119 w nasz\u0105 popkultur\u0119 tak g\u0142\u0119boko, \u017ce sta\u0142 si\u0119 niezwykle wa\u017cnym tekstem kultury, cytowanym przez pisarzy, tw\u00f3rc\u00f3w teatralnych i raper\u00f3w. M\u0142odzi wtedy aktorzy - Jared Leto, Jennifer Connelly i Marlon Wayans - z dnia na dzie\u0144 trafili na hollywoodzki szczyt, hipnotyzuj\u0105cy popis Ellen Burstyn przyni\u00f3s\u0142 jej nominacj\u0119 do Oscara, a sam re\u017cyser udowodni\u0142, \u017ce jest wizjonerem kina. Teraz, po 25 latach od premiery, film powraca do kin w odrestaurowanej wersji 4K. <br><br>\u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to wstrz\u0105saj\u0105ca opowie\u015b\u0107 o czw\u00f3rce bohater\u00f3w z Brooklynu, kt\u00f3rzy w pogoni za realizacj\u0105 swoich marze\u0144 odbywaj\u0105 podr\u00f3\u017c w g\u0142\u0105b piek\u0142a uzale\u017cnie\u0144. Dla rozprowadzaj\u0105cego narkotyki Harry'ego (Leto), jego uzale\u017cnionej od pigu\u0142ek na odchudzanie matki (Burstyn), pogr\u0105\u017conej w na\u0142ogu dziewczyny (Connelly) i najlepszego przyjaciela (Wayans) ucieczka od rzeczywisto\u015bci ko\u0144czy si\u0119 tragedi\u0105. Nie mog\u0105c sobie poradzi\u0107 z chaosem otaczaj\u0105cego ich wsp\u00f3\u0142czesnego \u015bwiata, ka\u017cde z nich popada w uzale\u017cnienie - od narkotyk\u00f3w, s\u0142odyczy lub telewizji.&nbsp; \u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to hipnotyczna opowie\u015b\u0107 o t\u0119sknocie za mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105, \u017cyciu w iluzji i k\u0142amstwie oraz o pu\u0142apce na\u0142ogu. <br><br>Ekranowego dramatu bohater\u00f3w dope\u0142nia genialny, \u015bwidruj\u0105cy m\u00f3zg soundtrack Clinta Mansella w wykonaniu Kronos Quartet. Motyw Lux Aeterna to muzyczny klasyk, po dzi\u015b dzie\u0144 bezlito\u015bnie przerabiany i samplowany. A samo \u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d, ogl\u0105dane po latach, wci\u0105\u017c funduje widzom szokuj\u0105cy, emocjonalny rollercoaster, po kt\u00f3rym trudno doj\u015b\u0107 do siebie.<\/span><\/font>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2001T2D135","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/2997\/1784032934.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60123":{"id":60123,"title":"Martwe z\u0142o 2 ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/martwe-zlo-2-2026-09-28-21-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3060\/1790077975.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T21:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 20:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 21:00:00"},"products":[{"id":119,"name":"Bilet tani pon.","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3060,"name":"Martwe z\u0142o 2 ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Ash Williams (Bruce Campbell) zabiera dziewczyn\u0119 do odludnej chaty w lesie na romantyczny weekend. Na miejscu znajduje magnetofon z nagraniem inkantacji z Necronomiconu, Ksi\u0119gi Umar\u0142ych \u2013 i naciska \u201eplay\u201d. To b\u0142\u0105d. Demony budz\u0105 si\u0119 natychmiast, dziewczyna zmienia si\u0119 w rozchichotane truch\u0142o, a sam Ash rozpoczyna najd\u0142u\u017csz\u0105 noc swojego \u017cycia: noc, podczas kt\u00f3rej jego w\u0142asna d\u0142o\u0144 zwr\u00f3ci si\u0119 przeciwko niemu, meble wybuchn\u0105 zbiorowym \u015bmiechem, a jedynym rozs\u0105dnym rozwi\u0105zaniem oka\u017ce si\u0119 pi\u0142a mechaniczna zamontowana na kikucie.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eMartwe z\u0142o 2\u201d Sama Raimiego to jeden z najzabawniejszych paradoks\u00f3w historii kina: sequel, kt\u00f3ry jest jednocze\u015bnie remakiem, parodi\u0105 i przelicytowaniem orygina\u0142u \u2013 i kt\u00f3ry zdefiniowa\u0142 gatunek splatstick, czyli slapstick zanurzony po \u0142okcie w hektolitrach posoki. Raimi, dysponuj\u0105c wreszcie porz\u0105dnym bud\u017cetem, przekszta\u0142ci\u0142 surowy horror swojego debiutu w kresk\u00f3wk\u0119 na \u017cywo: kamera szar\u017cuje przez las jak op\u0119tana (s\u0142ynne uj\u0119cia \u201ez perspektywy z\u0142a\u201d kr\u0119cono, przywi\u0105zuj\u0105c kamer\u0119 do deski niesionej przez biegn\u0105cych operator\u00f3w), scenografia jest wsp\u00f3\u0142sprawc\u0105 przemocy, a groza i groteska przestaj\u0105 by\u0107 przeciwie\u0144stwami, zlewaj\u0105c si\u0119 w jeden rozp\u0119dzony \u017cywio\u0142.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Ale prawdziwym cudem filmu jest Bruce Campbell. Jego Ash to arcydzie\u0142o fizycznej komedii: cz\u0142owiek ok\u0142adany przez ca\u0142y wszech\u015bwiat (w tym przez samego siebie \u2013 walka z w\u0142asn\u0105 r\u0119k\u0105 to pi\u0119\u0107 minut czystego geniuszu), kt\u00f3ry z ofiary przepoczwarza si\u0119 w przerysowanego macho. Kreacja ta uczyni\u0142a z Campbella wiecznego kr\u00f3la kina klasy B, a z Asha \u2013 jednego z najukocha\u0144szych bohater\u00f3w popkultury. W 4K ka\u017cda kropla sztucznej krwi (a s\u0105 jej tysi\u0105ce) l\u015bni jak nowa. [Grzegorz Fortuna<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div>Re\u017cyseria: Sam Raimi | Produkcja: USA, 1987 | Czas: 84'<\/div><div>Wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Bruce Campbell, Sarah Berry, Dan Hicks<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3060\/1790077975.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60074":{"id":60074,"title":"Marsupilami- dubbing ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/marsupilami-dubbing-2026-09-25-12-00-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3058\/1790074848.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T12:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 11:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 12:00:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3058,"name":"Marsupilami- dubbing ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Szalona, pe\u0142na humoru przygoda, w kt\u00f3rej w centrum akcji znajduje si\u0119 prawdziwy psotnik \u2013 tajemnicze stworzenie MARSUPILAMI! W polskiej wersji j\u0119zykowej us\u0142yszymy plejad\u0119 gwiazd: Cezarego Pazur\u0119, Magdalen\u0119 Boczarsk\u0105, Mateusza Banasiuka i Tomasza O\u015bwieci\u0144skiego. Podczas rejsu all-inclusive David, Tess i ich synek odkrywaj\u0105 w swoim baga\u017cu uroczego, \u017c\u00f3\u0142tego stworka w czarne c\u0119tki, kt\u00f3rego niewyobra\u017calnie d\u0142ugi ogon i nieposkromiony temperament w mgnieniu oka zamieniaj\u0105 rodzinne wakacje w totalny chaos \u2013 zw\u0142aszcza gdy okazuje si\u0119, \u017ce nowego przyjaciela ch\u0142opca pr\u00f3buje odnale\u017a\u0107 zdecydowanie zbyt wiele os\u00f3b!<\/span><\/font><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div style=\"\">Francja, Belgia 2025<\/div><div style=\"\">czas: 98\u2019<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/7aufdriIfNs?si=NA3F_J2cGcsSBBYS\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3058\/1790074848.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60106":{"id":60106,"title":"Tony ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/tony-2026-09-29-13-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788189036.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T13:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 12:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 13:15:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3046,"name":"Tony ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Anthony Bourdain \u2013 buntownik, outsider, g\u0142os pokolenia, jeden z najbardziej znanych szef\u00f3w kuchni i jedna z najwi\u0119kszych, najbardziej charyzmatycznych osobowo\u015bci telewizyjnych. Podr\u00f3\u017cnik, pisarz, odkrywca, kt\u00f3rego miliony ludzi na ca\u0142ym \u015bwiecie pokocha\u0142y za bezkompromisowy styl, mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107 do \u017cycia, szacunek do ludzi, odwag\u0119, ciekawo\u015b\u0107 \u015bwiata i autentyczno\u015b\u0107. TONY to historia pocz\u0105tk\u00f3w jego drogi \u2013 kim by\u0142, zanim sta\u0142 si\u0119 Anthonym Bourdainem.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Upalne lato 1976 roku, Provincetown \u2013 miasto pulsuj\u0105ce wolno\u015bci\u0105, seksem i energi\u0105. M\u0142ody, marz\u0105cy o karierze pisarza, Tony (Dominic Sessa), by podreperowa\u0107 bud\u017cet, trafia na zmywak do restauracji serwuj\u0105cej owoce morza, prowadzonej przez tajemniczego szefa kuchni (Antonio Banderas). W intensywnej, chaotycznej, a jednocze\u015bnie niezwykle kreatywnej atmosferze Tony odkrywa swoj\u0105 pasj\u0119, powo\u0142anie i to, kim tak naprawd\u0119 jest.<br><br><br>CZAS TRWANIA: 106 min.<br><br><br><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/uI88YvjFdgE?si=Phxn31Jy5UORGEXA\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T2D4342","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788189036.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60067":{"id":60067,"title":"Kumotry ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kumotry-2026-09-25-13-30-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1780645915.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T13:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 13:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 13:30:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2975,"name":"Kumotry ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Pustoszej\u0105ca polska wie\u015b w rumu\u0144skich Karpatach: wzruszaj\u0105cy film o pami\u0119ci, przyja\u017ani i przemijaniu. <br><br>Historia przyja\u017ani kobiet zamieszkuj\u0105cych wymieraj\u0105c\u0105 polsk\u0105 wie\u015b w rumu\u0144skich Karpatach. Hanka i Bronka pochowa\u0142y ju\u017c m\u0119\u017c\u00f3w, dzieci wyjecha\u0142y za granic\u0119 w poszukiwaniu innych, lepszych perspektyw. Samodzielne i niezale\u017cne bohaterki imponuj\u0105 pogod\u0105 ducha, cho\u0107 ich rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107 nieub\u0142aganie odchodzi w przesz\u0142o\u015b\u0107. Pozostaj\u0105 wspomnienia o czasach, kt\u00f3re ju\u017c nie wr\u00f3c\u0105 \u2013 i wsp\u00f3lne stawianie czo\u0142a wyzwaniom codzienno\u015bci. Nostalgiczny obraz nikn\u0105cego \u015bwiata skrzy si\u0119 bezpretensjonalnym humorem i zachwyca zdj\u0119ciami, oddaj\u0105cymi zniewalaj\u0105cy urok karpackiego pog\u00f3rza. Zwracaj\u0105c uwag\u0119 na szczeg\u00f3\u0142y, re\u017cyserka tworzy wzruszaj\u0105cy film o pami\u0119ci, przyja\u017ani i przemijaniu. Pokazuj\u0105c ludzi, kt\u00f3rzy potrafi\u0105 by\u0107 dla siebie wszystkim, sk\u0142ania nas do przewarto\u015bciowania priorytet\u00f3w i spojrzenia na rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107 z mniej ucz\u0119szczanej strony.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/WWeJxcoEvH0?si=MeApd5ksdM9Q6oq4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D6143","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1780645915.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60081":{"id":60081,"title":"Gorzkie \u015bwi\u0119ta ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/gorzkie-swieta-2026-09-25-13-45-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3003\/1784016423.png","date":"2026-09-29T13:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 13:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 13:45:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3003,"name":"Gorzkie \u015bwi\u0119ta ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Pedro Almod\u00f3var powraca w szczytowej formie z jednym ze swoich najbardziej osobistych film\u00f3w. W \u201eGorzkich \u015bwi\u0119tach\u201d - jego pierwszej od 5 lat hiszpa\u0144skoj\u0119zycznej produkcji - jest wszystko, za co widzowie kochaj\u0105 jego kino: nami\u0119tno\u015b\u0107, intensywne kolory, przewrotny humor i pe\u0142nokrwiste postaci, kt\u00f3re wymykaj\u0105 si\u0119 prostym schematom. Na ekranie pojawiaj\u0105 si\u0119 aktorzy i aktorki znani z wcze\u015bniejszych film\u00f3w re\u017cysera: B\u00e1rbara Lennie, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Victoria Luengo, Aitana S\u00e1nchez-Gij\u00f3n, Milena Smit oraz jedna z najwa\u017cniejszych muz Almod\u00f3vara \u2013 Rossy de Palma. <br><br>Bohaterk\u0105 filmu jest czterdziestoletnia Elza (B\u00e1rbara Lennie), kt\u00f3ra po \u015bmierci matki rzuca si\u0119 w wir pracy, nie pozwalaj\u0105c sobie na \u017ca\u0142ob\u0119. Dopiero atak paniki zmusza j\u0105 do zatrzymania si\u0119 i wyruszenia w podr\u00f3\u017c, kt\u00f3ra stanie si\u0119 konfrontacj\u0105 z przesz\u0142o\u015bci\u0105, utraconymi relacjami i niespe\u0142nionymi pragnieniami. Z przypadkowych spotka\u0144, emocjonalnych zwrot\u00f3w i splataj\u0105cych si\u0119 \u017cyciorys\u00f3w Almod\u00f3var tka opowie\u015b\u0107 o tym, jak pami\u0119\u0107, fikcja i pragnienie nieustannie przepisuj\u0105 nasze \u017cycie. <br><br>\u201eGorzkie \u015bwi\u0119ta\u201d to szczeg\u00f3lny prezent dla tych, kt\u00f3rzy dorastali z kinem hiszpa\u0144skiego mistrza \u2013 od \u201eKobiet na skraju za\u0142amania nerwowego\u201d, przez \u201eWszystko o mojej matce\u201d i \u201ePorozmawiaj z ni\u0105\u201d, po \u201eVolver\u201d, \u201ePrzerwane obj\u0119cia\u201d i \u201eB\u00f3l i blask\u201d. To tak\u017ce film, kt\u00f3ry idzie o krok dalej: jeszcze mocniej pokazuje, \u017ce ka\u017cdy z nas nie tylko prze\u017cywa w\u0142asn\u0105 histori\u0119, ale te\u017c bez ko\u0144ca j\u0105 sobie opowiada. Almod\u00f3var sk\u0142ada tu poruszaj\u0105ce wyznanie wiary w si\u0142\u0119 kina, pami\u0119ci i narracji.<\/span><br><br><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div style=\"\">re\u017cyseria: Pedro Almod\u00f3var<\/div><div style=\"\">aktorzy: B\u00e1rbara Lennie, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Aitana S\u00e1nchez-Gij\u00f3n, Victoria Luengo, Patrick Criado, Milena Smit, Quim Guti\u00e9rrez, Rossy de Palma, Carmen Machi<\/div><div style=\"\">Hiszpania 2026,111'<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/Nz7UX762UoA?si=qTp0m6qAgt8LR01B\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T2D4118","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3003\/1784016423.png","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60060":{"id":60060,"title":"Kura ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kura-2026-09-25-15-00-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786965128.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T15:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 14:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 15:00:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3030,"name":"Kura ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">G\u0142\u00f3wn\u0105 bohaterk\u0105 nowego filmu w\u0119gierskiego re\u017cysera Gy\u00f6rgya P\u00e1lfiego jest tytu\u0142owa kura. Pozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.<br><br>Trafia do greckiej nadmorskiej wioski, gdzie schwytana zostaje przez w\u0142a\u015bciciela podupad\u0142ej restauracji i si\u0142\u0105 rzeczy \u201ewchodzi\u201d do ludzkiego \u015bwiata. Jest uwa\u017cn\u0105 obserwatork\u0105 zupe\u0142nie obcej dla niej rzeczywisto\u015bci. Staje si\u0119 te\u017c niemym \u015bwiadkiem ludzkich dramat\u00f3w, zwi\u0105zanych z kryzysem migracyjnym, rodzinnymi konfliktami czy chciwo\u015bci\u0105. <br><br>W rol\u0119 g\u0142\u00f3wnej bohaterki wcieli\u0142o si\u0119 osiem prawdziwych w\u0119gierskich kur: Eszti, Szandi, Feri, Enci, Eti, Enik\u0151, N\u00f3ra i Anett. <br><br>Przyjmuj\u0105c nieoczywist\u0105 perspektyw\u0119, P\u00e1lfi opowiada o uniwersalnych warto\u015bciach \u2013 wolno\u015bci, bezpiecze\u0144stwie, macierzy\u0144stwie \u2013 jakich poszukuj\u0105 jak wida\u0107 nie tylko ludzie. W\u0119gierski re\u017cyser odwa\u017cnie \u0142\u0105czy filmowe gatunki, tworz\u0105c histori\u0119, kt\u00f3ra z jednej strony mo\u017ce nas bawi\u0107, a z drugiej jest prawdziwie poruszaj\u0105ca.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/L78WO1p_xnA?si=GsO3moP7sAFn8x5D\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D10792","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786965128.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60111":{"id":60111,"title":"Mistyczka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/mistyczka-2026-09-29-15-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T15:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 14:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 15:15:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3059,"name":"Mistyczka ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to poruszaj\u0105ca, inspirowana prawdziwymi wydarzeniami historia kobiety, kt\u00f3ra odwa\u017cy\u0142a si\u0119 p\u00f3j\u015b\u0107 za g\u0142osem serca i przekroczy\u0107 granic\u0119 tego, co znane. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o wewn\u0119trznej przemianie, poszukiwaniu sensu egzystencji i niezwyk\u0142ej drodze, kt\u00f3ra zaprowadzi\u0142a Alicj\u0119 Lenczewsk\u0105 do do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 wykraczaj\u0105cych poza materialn\u0105 rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Przez lata Alicja Lenczewska prowadzi\u0142a dynamiczne \u017cycie. By\u0142a wiernym cz\u0142onkiem partii komunistycznej i cenion\u0105 nauczycielk\u0105 \u2013 wymagaj\u0105c\u0105, odpowiedzialn\u0105 i ca\u0142kowicie oddan\u0105 swojej pracy. Uwielbia\u0142a zagraniczne podr\u00f3\u017ce. Wydawa\u0142o si\u0119, \u017ce jej przysz\u0142o\u015b\u0107 zosta\u0142a ju\u017c dawno napisana. A\u017c do dnia, w kt\u00f3rym jedno spotkanie odmieni\u0142o wszystko\u2026<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wbrew sceptycyzmowi otoczenia i w\u0142asnym l\u0119kom Alicja wkracza na \u015bcie\u017ck\u0119 g\u0142\u0119bokiego \u017cycia duchowego. Jej mistyczne zapiski pe\u0142ne szczero\u015bci, nadziei i m\u0105dro\u015bci z czasem trafiaj\u0105 do tysi\u0119cy ludzi szukaj\u0105cych odpowiedzi na najwa\u017cniejsze pytania o mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107, cierpienie, wiar\u0119 i sens \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to film, kt\u00f3ry porusza serce i sk\u0142ania do refleksji. Intymny portret niezwyk\u0142ej kobiety splata si\u0119 tu z uniwersaln\u0105 opowie\u015bci\u0105 o samotno\u015bci, odwadze i potrzebie odnalezienia \u015bwiat\u0142a nawet w najtrudniejszych momentach \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W roli Alicji Lenczewskiej wyst\u0119puje Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, tworz\u0105c jedn\u0105 z najbardziej poruszaj\u0105cych i dojrza\u0142ych kreacji w swojej karierze.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017c.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Jan Sobierajski<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">obsada&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Rados\u0142aw Pazura, Rafa\u0142 Sza\u0142ajko, Marcin Kwa\u015bny, Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, S\u0142awomir Orzechowski, Dariusz Kowalski, Filip Gur\u0142acz<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/oQiqr0HaqLA?si=lQmbZcfw6CEuHFPd\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60086":{"id":60086,"title":"Obcy ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/obcy-2026-09-25-15-45-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","date":"2026-09-29T15:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 15:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 15:45:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3022,"name":"Obcy ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d w re\u017cyserii Fran\u00e7ois Ozona to nowa ekranizacja jednej z najwybitniejszych francuskich powie\u015bci XX wieku autorstwa Alberta Camusa. Prezentowana w Konkursie G\u0142\u00f3wnym festiwalu w Wenecji&nbsp; to wci\u0105\u017c niezwykle aktualna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu sensu w \u015bwiecie, w kt\u00f3rym wszelki sens zosta\u0142 zagubiony.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d jest histori\u0105 Meursaulta, m\u0142odego m\u0119\u017cczyzny, skromnego urz\u0119dnika, kt\u00f3rego codziennej rutyny nie przerywa nawet \u015bmier\u0107 matki. Wszystko zmienia si\u0119 pewnego gor\u0105cego dnia, gdy na pla\u017cy dochodzi do tragicznego zdarzenia z jego udzia\u0142em.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Oszcz\u0119dne dialogi i pi\u0119kne czarno-bia\u0142e zdj\u0119cia, b\u0119d\u0105ce ho\u0142dem dla klasycznego kina, buduj\u0105 wyj\u0105tkow\u0105 atmosfer\u0119 filmu.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Re\u017cyseria: Fran\u00e7ois Ozon<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Benjamin Voisin, Rebecca Marder, Pierre Lottin, Denis Lavant, Swann Arlaud<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Francja 2025, 122'<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/b2yaQbsNAk0?si=m6suXUoNcKv7bWOG\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D10184","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60046":{"id":60046,"title":"Orlando ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/orlando-2026-09-25-16-45-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3050\/1789035126.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T16:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 16:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 16:45:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3050,"name":"Orlando ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W roku 1600 Orlando, m\u0142odzieniec z arystokratycznego rodu (Tilda Swinton), zostaje obrzucony kl\u0105tw\u0105 \"bycia m\u0142odym na wieki\" przez oczarowan\u0105 jego urod\u0105 kr\u00f3low\u0105 El\u017cbiet\u0119 I. 200 lat p\u00f3\u017aniej zostaje kobiet\u0105, kt\u00f3rej losy \u015bledzimy a\u017c po lata nam wsp\u00f3lczesne. Ubrana w pi\u0119kne obrazy lekko ironiczna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu w\u0142asnej to\u017csamo\u015bci. Film powsta\u0142 na podstawie powie\u015bci Virginii Wolf.<\/span><\/font><div><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017cyseria<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t<\/span>Sally Potter<\/span><\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Scenariusz Sally Potter<\/span><\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Obsada&nbsp;<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t<\/span>Tilda Swinton, Quentin Crisp, John Bott, Elaine Banham, Anna Farnworth<\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/div><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/SbT1KRbOn7o?si=a1OJGVu5KQsn5Tig\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"1992T2D454","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3050\/1789035126.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60114":{"id":60114,"title":"Powiedz mi, co czujesz ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/powiedz-mi-co-czujesz-2026-09-29-17-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789035367.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T17:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 16:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 17:00:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3051,"name":"Powiedz mi, co czujesz ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201ePowiedz mi, co czujesz\u201d to subtelna opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142o\u015bci dwojga m\u0142odych artyst\u00f3w, dla kt\u00f3rych pierwszy powa\u017cny zwi\u0105zek w doros\u0142ym \u017cyciu staje si\u0119 lustrem ich dawnych do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 i blizn. W rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych wyst\u0119puj\u0105 obiecuj\u0105cy aktorzy m\u0142odego pokolenia: Jan Sa\u0142asi\u0144ski, Izabella Dudziak oraz Sebastian Dela. Film jest inspirowany \u017cyciem i tw\u00f3rczo\u015bci\u0105 Patryka R\u00f3\u017cyckiego oraz Karoliny Balcer i projektem artystycznym \u201eSkup \u0141ez\u201d Alicji Rogalskiej i \u0141ukasza Surowca. <br><br>Bohaterowie maj\u0105 po dwadzie\u015bcia lat. Ona tworzy nietypowy projekt SKUP \u0141EZ, w kt\u00f3rym p\u0142aci ludziom za ich\u2026 \u0142zy. On - pocz\u0105tkuj\u0105cy artysta - nie potrafi p\u0142aka\u0107. Ich uczucie rozwija si\u0119 intensywnie i szybko, otwieraj\u0105c drog\u0119 do g\u0142\u0119bokiej przemiany, kt\u00f3ra oka\u017ce si\u0119 jednym z najwa\u017cniejszych do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 w ich \u017cyciu. \u201ePowiedz mi, co czujesz\u201d to poruszaj\u0105ca historia o intymnej blisko\u015bci i mi\u0142o\u015bci, kt\u00f3ra potrafi by\u0107 najlepszym terapeut\u0105.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/-gi8nuA6FRY?si=JywVNH1jU8tD5FCD\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T3D4311","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789035367.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60098":{"id":60098,"title":"Mistyczka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/mistyczka-2026-09-25-18-00-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T18:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 17:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 18:00:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3059,"name":"Mistyczka ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to poruszaj\u0105ca, inspirowana prawdziwymi wydarzeniami historia kobiety, kt\u00f3ra odwa\u017cy\u0142a si\u0119 p\u00f3j\u015b\u0107 za g\u0142osem serca i przekroczy\u0107 granic\u0119 tego, co znane. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o wewn\u0119trznej przemianie, poszukiwaniu sensu egzystencji i niezwyk\u0142ej drodze, kt\u00f3ra zaprowadzi\u0142a Alicj\u0119 Lenczewsk\u0105 do do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 wykraczaj\u0105cych poza materialn\u0105 rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Przez lata Alicja Lenczewska prowadzi\u0142a dynamiczne \u017cycie. By\u0142a wiernym cz\u0142onkiem partii komunistycznej i cenion\u0105 nauczycielk\u0105 \u2013 wymagaj\u0105c\u0105, odpowiedzialn\u0105 i ca\u0142kowicie oddan\u0105 swojej pracy. Uwielbia\u0142a zagraniczne podr\u00f3\u017ce. Wydawa\u0142o si\u0119, \u017ce jej przysz\u0142o\u015b\u0107 zosta\u0142a ju\u017c dawno napisana. A\u017c do dnia, w kt\u00f3rym jedno spotkanie odmieni\u0142o wszystko\u2026<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wbrew sceptycyzmowi otoczenia i w\u0142asnym l\u0119kom Alicja wkracza na \u015bcie\u017ck\u0119 g\u0142\u0119bokiego \u017cycia duchowego. Jej mistyczne zapiski pe\u0142ne szczero\u015bci, nadziei i m\u0105dro\u015bci z czasem trafiaj\u0105 do tysi\u0119cy ludzi szukaj\u0105cych odpowiedzi na najwa\u017cniejsze pytania o mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107, cierpienie, wiar\u0119 i sens \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to film, kt\u00f3ry porusza serce i sk\u0142ania do refleksji. Intymny portret niezwyk\u0142ej kobiety splata si\u0119 tu z uniwersaln\u0105 opowie\u015bci\u0105 o samotno\u015bci, odwadze i potrzebie odnalezienia \u015bwiat\u0142a nawet w najtrudniejszych momentach \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W roli Alicji Lenczewskiej wyst\u0119puje Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, tworz\u0105c jedn\u0105 z najbardziej poruszaj\u0105cych i dojrza\u0142ych kreacji w swojej karierze.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017c.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Jan Sobierajski<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">obsada&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Rados\u0142aw Pazura, Rafa\u0142 Sza\u0142ajko, Marcin Kwa\u015bny, Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, S\u0142awomir Orzechowski, Dariusz Kowalski, Filip Gur\u0142acz<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/oQiqr0HaqLA?si=lQmbZcfw6CEuHFPd\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60053":{"id":60053,"title":"Birthday Party ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/birthday-party-2026-09-25-18-30-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1790073908.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T18:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 18:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 18:30:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3057,"name":"Birthday Party ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wp\u0142ywowy grecki magnat \u015bwi\u0119tuje 25. urodziny c\u00f3rki na prywatnej wyspie otoczony gronem najpot\u0119\u017cniejszych ludzi \u015bwiata. W miar\u0119 rozwoju przyj\u0119cia na jaw zaczynaj\u0105 wychodzi\u0107 mroczne sekrety zebranych.<\/span><\/font><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017c. Miguel \u00c1ngel Jim\u00e9nez<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">obsada&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t<\/span>Willem Dafoe, Vic Carmen Sonne, Joe Cole<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div style=\"\">produkcja: Grecja, Hiszpania, Holandia, Wielka Brytania 2026<\/div><div style=\"\">j\u0119zyk: angielski<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/q66_3aPe6OA?si=5QPi75GoE7XsBJG6\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1790073908.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60119":{"id":60119,"title":"Obcy ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/obcy-2026-09-29-18-45","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","date":"2026-09-29T18:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 18:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 18:45:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3022,"name":"Obcy ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d w re\u017cyserii Fran\u00e7ois Ozona to nowa ekranizacja jednej z najwybitniejszych francuskich powie\u015bci XX wieku autorstwa Alberta Camusa. Prezentowana w Konkursie G\u0142\u00f3wnym festiwalu w Wenecji&nbsp; to wci\u0105\u017c niezwykle aktualna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu sensu w \u015bwiecie, w kt\u00f3rym wszelki sens zosta\u0142 zagubiony.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d jest histori\u0105 Meursaulta, m\u0142odego m\u0119\u017cczyzny, skromnego urz\u0119dnika, kt\u00f3rego codziennej rutyny nie przerywa nawet \u015bmier\u0107 matki. Wszystko zmienia si\u0119 pewnego gor\u0105cego dnia, gdy na pla\u017cy dochodzi do tragicznego zdarzenia z jego udzia\u0142em.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Oszcz\u0119dne dialogi i pi\u0119kne czarno-bia\u0142e zdj\u0119cia, b\u0119d\u0105ce ho\u0142dem dla klasycznego kina, buduj\u0105 wyj\u0105tkow\u0105 atmosfer\u0119 filmu.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Re\u017cyseria: Fran\u00e7ois Ozon<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Benjamin Voisin, Rebecca Marder, Pierre Lottin, Denis Lavant, Swann Arlaud<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Francja 2025, 122'<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/b2yaQbsNAk0?si=m6suXUoNcKv7bWOG\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D10184","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60093":{"id":60093,"title":"Powiedz mi, co czujesz ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/powiedz-mi-co-czujesz-2026-09-25-19-30-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789035367.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T19:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 19:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 19:30:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3051,"name":"Powiedz mi, co czujesz ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201ePowiedz mi, co czujesz\u201d to subtelna opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142o\u015bci dwojga m\u0142odych artyst\u00f3w, dla kt\u00f3rych pierwszy powa\u017cny zwi\u0105zek w doros\u0142ym \u017cyciu staje si\u0119 lustrem ich dawnych do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 i blizn. W rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych wyst\u0119puj\u0105 obiecuj\u0105cy aktorzy m\u0142odego pokolenia: Jan Sa\u0142asi\u0144ski, Izabella Dudziak oraz Sebastian Dela. Film jest inspirowany \u017cyciem i tw\u00f3rczo\u015bci\u0105 Patryka R\u00f3\u017cyckiego oraz Karoliny Balcer i projektem artystycznym \u201eSkup \u0141ez\u201d Alicji Rogalskiej i \u0141ukasza Surowca. <br><br>Bohaterowie maj\u0105 po dwadzie\u015bcia lat. Ona tworzy nietypowy projekt SKUP \u0141EZ, w kt\u00f3rym p\u0142aci ludziom za ich\u2026 \u0142zy. On - pocz\u0105tkuj\u0105cy artysta - nie potrafi p\u0142aka\u0107. Ich uczucie rozwija si\u0119 intensywnie i szybko, otwieraj\u0105c drog\u0119 do g\u0142\u0119bokiej przemiany, kt\u00f3ra oka\u017ce si\u0119 jednym z najwa\u017cniejszych do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 w ich \u017cyciu. \u201ePowiedz mi, co czujesz\u201d to poruszaj\u0105ca historia o intymnej blisko\u015bci i mi\u0142o\u015bci, kt\u00f3ra potrafi by\u0107 najlepszym terapeut\u0105.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/-gi8nuA6FRY?si=JywVNH1jU8tD5FCD\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T3D4311","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789035367.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60039":{"id":60039,"title":"Requiem dla snu  ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/requiem-dla-snu-2026-09-25-20-30-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/2997\/1784032934.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T20:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 20:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2997,"name":"Requiem dla snu  ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to drugi pe\u0142nometra\u017cowy film Darrena Aronofsky\u2019ego, na podstawie powie\u015bci legendarnego ameryka\u0144skiego pisarza, Huberta Selby\u2019ego Jr. \u0106wier\u0107 wieku temu trafi\u0142 do Polski dzi\u0119ki dystrybucji Gutek Film i wry\u0142 si\u0119 w nasz\u0105 popkultur\u0119 tak g\u0142\u0119boko, \u017ce sta\u0142 si\u0119 niezwykle wa\u017cnym tekstem kultury, cytowanym przez pisarzy, tw\u00f3rc\u00f3w teatralnych i raper\u00f3w. M\u0142odzi wtedy aktorzy - Jared Leto, Jennifer Connelly i Marlon Wayans - z dnia na dzie\u0144 trafili na hollywoodzki szczyt, hipnotyzuj\u0105cy popis Ellen Burstyn przyni\u00f3s\u0142 jej nominacj\u0119 do Oscara, a sam re\u017cyser udowodni\u0142, \u017ce jest wizjonerem kina. Teraz, po 25 latach od premiery, film powraca do kin w odrestaurowanej wersji 4K. <br><br>\u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to wstrz\u0105saj\u0105ca opowie\u015b\u0107 o czw\u00f3rce bohater\u00f3w z Brooklynu, kt\u00f3rzy w pogoni za realizacj\u0105 swoich marze\u0144 odbywaj\u0105 podr\u00f3\u017c w g\u0142\u0105b piek\u0142a uzale\u017cnie\u0144. Dla rozprowadzaj\u0105cego narkotyki Harry'ego (Leto), jego uzale\u017cnionej od pigu\u0142ek na odchudzanie matki (Burstyn), pogr\u0105\u017conej w na\u0142ogu dziewczyny (Connelly) i najlepszego przyjaciela (Wayans) ucieczka od rzeczywisto\u015bci ko\u0144czy si\u0119 tragedi\u0105. Nie mog\u0105c sobie poradzi\u0107 z chaosem otaczaj\u0105cego ich wsp\u00f3\u0142czesnego \u015bwiata, ka\u017cde z nich popada w uzale\u017cnienie - od narkotyk\u00f3w, s\u0142odyczy lub telewizji.&nbsp; \u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to hipnotyczna opowie\u015b\u0107 o t\u0119sknocie za mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105, \u017cyciu w iluzji i k\u0142amstwie oraz o pu\u0142apce na\u0142ogu. <br><br>Ekranowego dramatu bohater\u00f3w dope\u0142nia genialny, \u015bwidruj\u0105cy m\u00f3zg soundtrack Clinta Mansella w wykonaniu Kronos Quartet. Motyw Lux Aeterna to muzyczny klasyk, po dzi\u015b dzie\u0144 bezlito\u015bnie przerabiany i samplowany. A samo \u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d, ogl\u0105dane po latach, wci\u0105\u017c funduje widzom szokuj\u0105cy, emocjonalny rollercoaster, po kt\u00f3rym trudno doj\u015b\u0107 do siebie.<\/span><\/font>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2001T2D135","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/2997\/1784032934.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60124":{"id":60124,"title":"Martwe z\u0142o 2 ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/martwe-zlo-2-2026-09-29-21-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3060\/1790077975.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T21:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 20:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 21:00:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3060,"name":"Martwe z\u0142o 2 ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Ash Williams (Bruce Campbell) zabiera dziewczyn\u0119 do odludnej chaty w lesie na romantyczny weekend. Na miejscu znajduje magnetofon z nagraniem inkantacji z Necronomiconu, Ksi\u0119gi Umar\u0142ych \u2013 i naciska \u201eplay\u201d. To b\u0142\u0105d. Demony budz\u0105 si\u0119 natychmiast, dziewczyna zmienia si\u0119 w rozchichotane truch\u0142o, a sam Ash rozpoczyna najd\u0142u\u017csz\u0105 noc swojego \u017cycia: noc, podczas kt\u00f3rej jego w\u0142asna d\u0142o\u0144 zwr\u00f3ci si\u0119 przeciwko niemu, meble wybuchn\u0105 zbiorowym \u015bmiechem, a jedynym rozs\u0105dnym rozwi\u0105zaniem oka\u017ce si\u0119 pi\u0142a mechaniczna zamontowana na kikucie.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eMartwe z\u0142o 2\u201d Sama Raimiego to jeden z najzabawniejszych paradoks\u00f3w historii kina: sequel, kt\u00f3ry jest jednocze\u015bnie remakiem, parodi\u0105 i przelicytowaniem orygina\u0142u \u2013 i kt\u00f3ry zdefiniowa\u0142 gatunek splatstick, czyli slapstick zanurzony po \u0142okcie w hektolitrach posoki. Raimi, dysponuj\u0105c wreszcie porz\u0105dnym bud\u017cetem, przekszta\u0142ci\u0142 surowy horror swojego debiutu w kresk\u00f3wk\u0119 na \u017cywo: kamera szar\u017cuje przez las jak op\u0119tana (s\u0142ynne uj\u0119cia \u201ez perspektywy z\u0142a\u201d kr\u0119cono, przywi\u0105zuj\u0105c kamer\u0119 do deski niesionej przez biegn\u0105cych operator\u00f3w), scenografia jest wsp\u00f3\u0142sprawc\u0105 przemocy, a groza i groteska przestaj\u0105 by\u0107 przeciwie\u0144stwami, zlewaj\u0105c si\u0119 w jeden rozp\u0119dzony \u017cywio\u0142.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Ale prawdziwym cudem filmu jest Bruce Campbell. Jego Ash to arcydzie\u0142o fizycznej komedii: cz\u0142owiek ok\u0142adany przez ca\u0142y wszech\u015bwiat (w tym przez samego siebie \u2013 walka z w\u0142asn\u0105 r\u0119k\u0105 to pi\u0119\u0107 minut czystego geniuszu), kt\u00f3ry z ofiary przepoczwarza si\u0119 w przerysowanego macho. Kreacja ta uczyni\u0142a z Campbella wiecznego kr\u00f3la kina klasy B, a z Asha \u2013 jednego z najukocha\u0144szych bohater\u00f3w popkultury. W 4K ka\u017cda kropla sztucznej krwi (a s\u0105 jej tysi\u0105ce) l\u015bni jak nowa. [Grzegorz Fortuna<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div>Re\u017cyseria: Sam Raimi | Produkcja: USA, 1987 | Czas: 84'<\/div><div>Wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Bruce Campbell, Sarah Berry, Dan Hicks<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3060\/1790077975.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60068":{"id":60068,"title":"Kumotry ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kumotry-2026-09-30-12-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1780645915.jpg","date":"2026-09-30T12:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 11:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 12:00:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2975,"name":"Kumotry ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Pustoszej\u0105ca polska wie\u015b w rumu\u0144skich Karpatach: wzruszaj\u0105cy film o pami\u0119ci, przyja\u017ani i przemijaniu. <br><br>Historia przyja\u017ani kobiet zamieszkuj\u0105cych wymieraj\u0105c\u0105 polsk\u0105 wie\u015b w rumu\u0144skich Karpatach. Hanka i Bronka pochowa\u0142y ju\u017c m\u0119\u017c\u00f3w, dzieci wyjecha\u0142y za granic\u0119 w poszukiwaniu innych, lepszych perspektyw. Samodzielne i niezale\u017cne bohaterki imponuj\u0105 pogod\u0105 ducha, cho\u0107 ich rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107 nieub\u0142aganie odchodzi w przesz\u0142o\u015b\u0107. Pozostaj\u0105 wspomnienia o czasach, kt\u00f3re ju\u017c nie wr\u00f3c\u0105 \u2013 i wsp\u00f3lne stawianie czo\u0142a wyzwaniom codzienno\u015bci. Nostalgiczny obraz nikn\u0105cego \u015bwiata skrzy si\u0119 bezpretensjonalnym humorem i zachwyca zdj\u0119ciami, oddaj\u0105cymi zniewalaj\u0105cy urok karpackiego pog\u00f3rza. Zwracaj\u0105c uwag\u0119 na szczeg\u00f3\u0142y, re\u017cyserka tworzy wzruszaj\u0105cy film o pami\u0119ci, przyja\u017ani i przemijaniu. Pokazuj\u0105c ludzi, kt\u00f3rzy potrafi\u0105 by\u0107 dla siebie wszystkim, sk\u0142ania nas do przewarto\u015bciowania priorytet\u00f3w i spojrzenia na rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107 z mniej ucz\u0119szczanej strony.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/WWeJxcoEvH0?si=MeApd5ksdM9Q6oq4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D6143","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1780645915.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60075":{"id":60075,"title":"Marsupilami- dubbing ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/marsupilami-dubbing-2026-09-30-12-45","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3058\/1790074848.jpg","date":"2026-09-30T12:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 12:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 12:45:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3058,"name":"Marsupilami- dubbing ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Szalona, pe\u0142na humoru przygoda, w kt\u00f3rej w centrum akcji znajduje si\u0119 prawdziwy psotnik \u2013 tajemnicze stworzenie MARSUPILAMI! W polskiej wersji j\u0119zykowej us\u0142yszymy plejad\u0119 gwiazd: Cezarego Pazur\u0119, Magdalen\u0119 Boczarsk\u0105, Mateusza Banasiuka i Tomasza O\u015bwieci\u0144skiego. Podczas rejsu all-inclusive David, Tess i ich synek odkrywaj\u0105 w swoim baga\u017cu uroczego, \u017c\u00f3\u0142tego stworka w czarne c\u0119tki, kt\u00f3rego niewyobra\u017calnie d\u0142ugi ogon i nieposkromiony temperament w mgnieniu oka zamieniaj\u0105 rodzinne wakacje w totalny chaos \u2013 zw\u0142aszcza gdy okazuje si\u0119, \u017ce nowego przyjaciela ch\u0142opca pr\u00f3buje odnale\u017a\u0107 zdecydowanie zbyt wiele os\u00f3b!<\/span><\/font><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div style=\"\">Francja, Belgia 2025<\/div><div style=\"\">czas: 98\u2019<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/7aufdriIfNs?si=NA3F_J2cGcsSBBYS\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3058\/1790074848.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60061":{"id":60061,"title":"Kura ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kura-2026-09-30-13-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786965128.jpg","date":"2026-09-30T13:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 13:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 13:30:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3030,"name":"Kura ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">G\u0142\u00f3wn\u0105 bohaterk\u0105 nowego filmu w\u0119gierskiego re\u017cysera Gy\u00f6rgya P\u00e1lfiego jest tytu\u0142owa kura. Pozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.<br><br>Trafia do greckiej nadmorskiej wioski, gdzie schwytana zostaje przez w\u0142a\u015bciciela podupad\u0142ej restauracji i si\u0142\u0105 rzeczy \u201ewchodzi\u201d do ludzkiego \u015bwiata. Jest uwa\u017cn\u0105 obserwatork\u0105 zupe\u0142nie obcej dla niej rzeczywisto\u015bci. Staje si\u0119 te\u017c niemym \u015bwiadkiem ludzkich dramat\u00f3w, zwi\u0105zanych z kryzysem migracyjnym, rodzinnymi konfliktami czy chciwo\u015bci\u0105. <br><br>W rol\u0119 g\u0142\u00f3wnej bohaterki wcieli\u0142o si\u0119 osiem prawdziwych w\u0119gierskich kur: Eszti, Szandi, Feri, Enci, Eti, Enik\u0151, N\u00f3ra i Anett. <br><br>Przyjmuj\u0105c nieoczywist\u0105 perspektyw\u0119, P\u00e1lfi opowiada o uniwersalnych warto\u015bciach \u2013 wolno\u015bci, bezpiecze\u0144stwie, macierzy\u0144stwie \u2013 jakich poszukuj\u0105 jak wida\u0107 nie tylko ludzie. W\u0119gierski re\u017cyser odwa\u017cnie \u0142\u0105czy filmowe gatunki, tworz\u0105c histori\u0119, kt\u00f3ra z jednej strony mo\u017ce nas bawi\u0107, a z drugiej jest prawdziwie poruszaj\u0105ca.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/L78WO1p_xnA?si=GsO3moP7sAFn8x5D\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D10792","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786965128.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60126":{"id":60126,"title":"Lalka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-09-29-13-45-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3054\/1789115373.jpg","date":"2026-09-30T13:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":120,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 13:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 13:45:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":120}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3054,"name":"Lalka ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Nowa ekranizacja \u201eLalki\u201d to opowiedziana ze wsp\u00f3\u0142czesn\u0105 wra\u017cliwo\u015bci\u0105 przejmuj\u0105ca, uniwersalna historia o mi\u0142o\u015bci i niespe\u0142nieniu, o aspiracjach i przemianie, o \u015bwiecie, kt\u00f3ry w\u0142a\u015bnie si\u0119 ko\u0144czy. To film, kt\u00f3ry zdarza si\u0119 raz na kilka dekad: epicki, pe\u0142en emocji, zrealizowany z imponuj\u0105c\u0105 scenografi\u0105, dopracowanymi w najdrobniejszych detalach kostiumami i charakteryzacj\u0105 oraz prawdziwie gwiazdorsk\u0105 obsad\u0105.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eLalka\u201d to zrealizowana z ogromnym rozmachem superprodukcja i najbardziej gwiazdorski film w historii polskiego kina, gdzie po\u015br\u00f3d wielu wybitnych nazwisk, w rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski jako Stanis\u0142aw Wokulski, gwiazda \u201eCh\u0142op\u00f3w\u201d \u2013 Kamila Urz\u0119dowska jako Izabela \u0141\u0119cka oraz powracaj\u0105cy na wielki ekran po 16 latach Marek Kondrat w roli Ignacego Rzeckiego.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div>re\u017cyseria: Maciej Kawalski<\/div><div>aktorzy: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski, Kamila Urz\u0119dowska, Marek Kondrat, Andrzej Seweryn, Maria D\u0119bska<\/div><div>Polska 2026, 162'<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><br><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/UsmL7HKwVWM?si=3IgVscJSbOjSguXT\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3054\/1789115373.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60099":{"id":60099,"title":"Mistyczka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/mistyczka-2026-09-30-14-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","date":"2026-09-30T14:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 14:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 14:30:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3059,"name":"Mistyczka ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to poruszaj\u0105ca, inspirowana prawdziwymi wydarzeniami historia kobiety, kt\u00f3ra odwa\u017cy\u0142a si\u0119 p\u00f3j\u015b\u0107 za g\u0142osem serca i przekroczy\u0107 granic\u0119 tego, co znane. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o wewn\u0119trznej przemianie, poszukiwaniu sensu egzystencji i niezwyk\u0142ej drodze, kt\u00f3ra zaprowadzi\u0142a Alicj\u0119 Lenczewsk\u0105 do do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 wykraczaj\u0105cych poza materialn\u0105 rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Przez lata Alicja Lenczewska prowadzi\u0142a dynamiczne \u017cycie. By\u0142a wiernym cz\u0142onkiem partii komunistycznej i cenion\u0105 nauczycielk\u0105 \u2013 wymagaj\u0105c\u0105, odpowiedzialn\u0105 i ca\u0142kowicie oddan\u0105 swojej pracy. Uwielbia\u0142a zagraniczne podr\u00f3\u017ce. Wydawa\u0142o si\u0119, \u017ce jej przysz\u0142o\u015b\u0107 zosta\u0142a ju\u017c dawno napisana. A\u017c do dnia, w kt\u00f3rym jedno spotkanie odmieni\u0142o wszystko\u2026<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wbrew sceptycyzmowi otoczenia i w\u0142asnym l\u0119kom Alicja wkracza na \u015bcie\u017ck\u0119 g\u0142\u0119bokiego \u017cycia duchowego. Jej mistyczne zapiski pe\u0142ne szczero\u015bci, nadziei i m\u0105dro\u015bci z czasem trafiaj\u0105 do tysi\u0119cy ludzi szukaj\u0105cych odpowiedzi na najwa\u017cniejsze pytania o mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107, cierpienie, wiar\u0119 i sens \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to film, kt\u00f3ry porusza serce i sk\u0142ania do refleksji. Intymny portret niezwyk\u0142ej kobiety splata si\u0119 tu z uniwersaln\u0105 opowie\u015bci\u0105 o samotno\u015bci, odwadze i potrzebie odnalezienia \u015bwiat\u0142a nawet w najtrudniejszych momentach \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W roli Alicji Lenczewskiej wyst\u0119puje Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, tworz\u0105c jedn\u0105 z najbardziej poruszaj\u0105cych i dojrza\u0142ych kreacji w swojej karierze.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017c.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Jan Sobierajski<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">obsada&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Rados\u0142aw Pazura, Rafa\u0142 Sza\u0142ajko, Marcin Kwa\u015bny, Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, S\u0142awomir Orzechowski, Dariusz Kowalski, Filip Gur\u0142acz<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/oQiqr0HaqLA?si=lQmbZcfw6CEuHFPd\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60047":{"id":60047,"title":"Orlando ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/orlando-2026-09-30-15-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3050\/1789035126.jpg","date":"2026-09-30T15:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 14:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 15:15:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3050,"name":"Orlando ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W roku 1600 Orlando, m\u0142odzieniec z arystokratycznego rodu (Tilda Swinton), zostaje obrzucony kl\u0105tw\u0105 \"bycia m\u0142odym na wieki\" przez oczarowan\u0105 jego urod\u0105 kr\u00f3low\u0105 El\u017cbiet\u0119 I. 200 lat p\u00f3\u017aniej zostaje kobiet\u0105, kt\u00f3rej losy \u015bledzimy a\u017c po lata nam wsp\u00f3lczesne. Ubrana w pi\u0119kne obrazy lekko ironiczna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu w\u0142asnej to\u017csamo\u015bci. Film powsta\u0142 na podstawie powie\u015bci Virginii Wolf.<\/span><\/font><div><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017cyseria<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t<\/span>Sally Potter<\/span><\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Scenariusz Sally Potter<\/span><\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Obsada&nbsp;<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t<\/span>Tilda Swinton, Quentin Crisp, John Bott, Elaine Banham, Anna Farnworth<\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/div><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/SbT1KRbOn7o?si=a1OJGVu5KQsn5Tig\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"1992T2D454","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3050\/1789035126.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60087":{"id":60087,"title":"Obcy ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/obcy-2026-09-30-16-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","date":"2026-09-30T16:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 15:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 16:15:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3022,"name":"Obcy ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d w re\u017cyserii Fran\u00e7ois Ozona to nowa ekranizacja jednej z najwybitniejszych francuskich powie\u015bci XX wieku autorstwa Alberta Camusa. Prezentowana w Konkursie G\u0142\u00f3wnym festiwalu w Wenecji&nbsp; to wci\u0105\u017c niezwykle aktualna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu sensu w \u015bwiecie, w kt\u00f3rym wszelki sens zosta\u0142 zagubiony.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d jest histori\u0105 Meursaulta, m\u0142odego m\u0119\u017cczyzny, skromnego urz\u0119dnika, kt\u00f3rego codziennej rutyny nie przerywa nawet \u015bmier\u0107 matki. Wszystko zmienia si\u0119 pewnego gor\u0105cego dnia, gdy na pla\u017cy dochodzi do tragicznego zdarzenia z jego udzia\u0142em.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Oszcz\u0119dne dialogi i pi\u0119kne czarno-bia\u0142e zdj\u0119cia, b\u0119d\u0105ce ho\u0142dem dla klasycznego kina, buduj\u0105 wyj\u0105tkow\u0105 atmosfer\u0119 filmu.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Re\u017cyseria: Fran\u00e7ois Ozon<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Benjamin Voisin, Rebecca Marder, Pierre Lottin, Denis Lavant, Swann Arlaud<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Francja 2025, 122'<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/b2yaQbsNAk0?si=m6suXUoNcKv7bWOG\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D10184","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60027":{"id":60027,"title":"Lalka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-09-30-16-45","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3054\/1789115373.jpg","date":"2026-09-30T16:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":113,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 16:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-11 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 16:45:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":113}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3054,"name":"Lalka ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Nowa ekranizacja \u201eLalki\u201d to opowiedziana ze wsp\u00f3\u0142czesn\u0105 wra\u017cliwo\u015bci\u0105 przejmuj\u0105ca, uniwersalna historia o mi\u0142o\u015bci i niespe\u0142nieniu, o aspiracjach i przemianie, o \u015bwiecie, kt\u00f3ry w\u0142a\u015bnie si\u0119 ko\u0144czy. To film, kt\u00f3ry zdarza si\u0119 raz na kilka dekad: epicki, pe\u0142en emocji, zrealizowany z imponuj\u0105c\u0105 scenografi\u0105, dopracowanymi w najdrobniejszych detalach kostiumami i charakteryzacj\u0105 oraz prawdziwie gwiazdorsk\u0105 obsad\u0105.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eLalka\u201d to zrealizowana z ogromnym rozmachem superprodukcja i najbardziej gwiazdorski film w historii polskiego kina, gdzie po\u015br\u00f3d wielu wybitnych nazwisk, w rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski jako Stanis\u0142aw Wokulski, gwiazda \u201eCh\u0142op\u00f3w\u201d \u2013 Kamila Urz\u0119dowska jako Izabela \u0141\u0119cka oraz powracaj\u0105cy na wielki ekran po 16 latach Marek Kondrat w roli Ignacego Rzeckiego.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div>re\u017cyseria: Maciej Kawalski<\/div><div>aktorzy: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski, Kamila Urz\u0119dowska, Marek Kondrat, Andrzej Seweryn, Maria D\u0119bska<\/div><div>Polska 2026, 162'<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><br><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/UsmL7HKwVWM?si=3IgVscJSbOjSguXT\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3054\/1789115373.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60054":{"id":60054,"title":"Birthday Party ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/birthday-party-2026-09-30-17-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1790073908.jpg","date":"2026-09-30T17:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 16:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 17:00:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3057,"name":"Birthday Party ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wp\u0142ywowy grecki magnat \u015bwi\u0119tuje 25. urodziny c\u00f3rki na prywatnej wyspie otoczony gronem najpot\u0119\u017cniejszych ludzi \u015bwiata. W miar\u0119 rozwoju przyj\u0119cia na jaw zaczynaj\u0105 wychodzi\u0107 mroczne sekrety zebranych.<\/span><\/font><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017c. Miguel \u00c1ngel Jim\u00e9nez<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">obsada&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t<\/span>Willem Dafoe, Vic Carmen Sonne, Joe Cole<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div style=\"\">produkcja: Grecja, Hiszpania, Holandia, Wielka Brytania 2026<\/div><div style=\"\">j\u0119zyk: angielski<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/q66_3aPe6OA?si=5QPi75GoE7XsBJG6\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1790073908.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60019":{"id":60019,"title":"Lalka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-09-30-19-45","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3054\/1789115373.jpg","date":"2026-09-30T19:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":113,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 19:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-11 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 19:45:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":113}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3054,"name":"Lalka ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Nowa ekranizacja \u201eLalki\u201d to opowiedziana ze wsp\u00f3\u0142czesn\u0105 wra\u017cliwo\u015bci\u0105 przejmuj\u0105ca, uniwersalna historia o mi\u0142o\u015bci i niespe\u0142nieniu, o aspiracjach i przemianie, o \u015bwiecie, kt\u00f3ry w\u0142a\u015bnie si\u0119 ko\u0144czy. To film, kt\u00f3ry zdarza si\u0119 raz na kilka dekad: epicki, pe\u0142en emocji, zrealizowany z imponuj\u0105c\u0105 scenografi\u0105, dopracowanymi w najdrobniejszych detalach kostiumami i charakteryzacj\u0105 oraz prawdziwie gwiazdorsk\u0105 obsad\u0105.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eLalka\u201d to zrealizowana z ogromnym rozmachem superprodukcja i najbardziej gwiazdorski film w historii polskiego kina, gdzie po\u015br\u00f3d wielu wybitnych nazwisk, w rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski jako Stanis\u0142aw Wokulski, gwiazda \u201eCh\u0142op\u00f3w\u201d \u2013 Kamila Urz\u0119dowska jako Izabela \u0141\u0119cka oraz powracaj\u0105cy na wielki ekran po 16 latach Marek Kondrat w roli Ignacego Rzeckiego.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div>re\u017cyseria: Maciej Kawalski<\/div><div>aktorzy: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski, Kamila Urz\u0119dowska, Marek Kondrat, Andrzej Seweryn, Maria D\u0119bska<\/div><div>Polska 2026, 162'<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><br><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/UsmL7HKwVWM?si=3IgVscJSbOjSguXT\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3054\/1789115373.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60040":{"id":60040,"title":"Requiem dla snu  ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/requiem-dla-snu-2026-09-25-20-30-5","image":"\/uploads\/event\/2997\/1784032934.jpg","date":"2026-09-30T20:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 20:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2997,"name":"Requiem dla snu  ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to drugi pe\u0142nometra\u017cowy film Darrena Aronofsky\u2019ego, na podstawie powie\u015bci legendarnego ameryka\u0144skiego pisarza, Huberta Selby\u2019ego Jr. \u0106wier\u0107 wieku temu trafi\u0142 do Polski dzi\u0119ki dystrybucji Gutek Film i wry\u0142 si\u0119 w nasz\u0105 popkultur\u0119 tak g\u0142\u0119boko, \u017ce sta\u0142 si\u0119 niezwykle wa\u017cnym tekstem kultury, cytowanym przez pisarzy, tw\u00f3rc\u00f3w teatralnych i raper\u00f3w. M\u0142odzi wtedy aktorzy - Jared Leto, Jennifer Connelly i Marlon Wayans - z dnia na dzie\u0144 trafili na hollywoodzki szczyt, hipnotyzuj\u0105cy popis Ellen Burstyn przyni\u00f3s\u0142 jej nominacj\u0119 do Oscara, a sam re\u017cyser udowodni\u0142, \u017ce jest wizjonerem kina. Teraz, po 25 latach od premiery, film powraca do kin w odrestaurowanej wersji 4K. <br><br>\u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to wstrz\u0105saj\u0105ca opowie\u015b\u0107 o czw\u00f3rce bohater\u00f3w z Brooklynu, kt\u00f3rzy w pogoni za realizacj\u0105 swoich marze\u0144 odbywaj\u0105 podr\u00f3\u017c w g\u0142\u0105b piek\u0142a uzale\u017cnie\u0144. Dla rozprowadzaj\u0105cego narkotyki Harry'ego (Leto), jego uzale\u017cnionej od pigu\u0142ek na odchudzanie matki (Burstyn), pogr\u0105\u017conej w na\u0142ogu dziewczyny (Connelly) i najlepszego przyjaciela (Wayans) ucieczka od rzeczywisto\u015bci ko\u0144czy si\u0119 tragedi\u0105. Nie mog\u0105c sobie poradzi\u0107 z chaosem otaczaj\u0105cego ich wsp\u00f3\u0142czesnego \u015bwiata, ka\u017cde z nich popada w uzale\u017cnienie - od narkotyk\u00f3w, s\u0142odyczy lub telewizji.&nbsp; \u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to hipnotyczna opowie\u015b\u0107 o t\u0119sknocie za mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105, \u017cyciu w iluzji i k\u0142amstwie oraz o pu\u0142apce na\u0142ogu. <br><br>Ekranowego dramatu bohater\u00f3w dope\u0142nia genialny, \u015bwidruj\u0105cy m\u00f3zg soundtrack Clinta Mansella w wykonaniu Kronos Quartet. Motyw Lux Aeterna to muzyczny klasyk, po dzi\u015b dzie\u0144 bezlito\u015bnie przerabiany i samplowany. A samo \u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d, ogl\u0105dane po latach, wci\u0105\u017c funduje widzom szokuj\u0105cy, emocjonalny rollercoaster, po kt\u00f3rym trudno doj\u015b\u0107 do siebie.<\/span><\/font>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2001T2D135","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/2997\/1784032934.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60076":{"id":60076,"title":"Marsupilami- dubbing ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/marsupilami-dubbing-2026-10-01-12-45","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3058\/1790074848.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T12:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 12:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 12:45:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3058,"name":"Marsupilami- dubbing ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Szalona, pe\u0142na humoru przygoda, w kt\u00f3rej w centrum akcji znajduje si\u0119 prawdziwy psotnik \u2013 tajemnicze stworzenie MARSUPILAMI! W polskiej wersji j\u0119zykowej us\u0142yszymy plejad\u0119 gwiazd: Cezarego Pazur\u0119, Magdalen\u0119 Boczarsk\u0105, Mateusza Banasiuka i Tomasza O\u015bwieci\u0144skiego. Podczas rejsu all-inclusive David, Tess i ich synek odkrywaj\u0105 w swoim baga\u017cu uroczego, \u017c\u00f3\u0142tego stworka w czarne c\u0119tki, kt\u00f3rego niewyobra\u017calnie d\u0142ugi ogon i nieposkromiony temperament w mgnieniu oka zamieniaj\u0105 rodzinne wakacje w totalny chaos \u2013 zw\u0142aszcza gdy okazuje si\u0119, \u017ce nowego przyjaciela ch\u0142opca pr\u00f3buje odnale\u017a\u0107 zdecydowanie zbyt wiele os\u00f3b!<\/span><\/font><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div style=\"\">Francja, Belgia 2025<\/div><div style=\"\">czas: 98\u2019<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/7aufdriIfNs?si=NA3F_J2cGcsSBBYS\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3058\/1790074848.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60069":{"id":60069,"title":"Kumotry ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kumotry-2026-09-25-13-30-6","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1780645915.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T13:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 13:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 13:30:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2975,"name":"Kumotry ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Pustoszej\u0105ca polska wie\u015b w rumu\u0144skich Karpatach: wzruszaj\u0105cy film o pami\u0119ci, przyja\u017ani i przemijaniu. <br><br>Historia przyja\u017ani kobiet zamieszkuj\u0105cych wymieraj\u0105c\u0105 polsk\u0105 wie\u015b w rumu\u0144skich Karpatach. Hanka i Bronka pochowa\u0142y ju\u017c m\u0119\u017c\u00f3w, dzieci wyjecha\u0142y za granic\u0119 w poszukiwaniu innych, lepszych perspektyw. Samodzielne i niezale\u017cne bohaterki imponuj\u0105 pogod\u0105 ducha, cho\u0107 ich rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107 nieub\u0142aganie odchodzi w przesz\u0142o\u015b\u0107. Pozostaj\u0105 wspomnienia o czasach, kt\u00f3re ju\u017c nie wr\u00f3c\u0105 \u2013 i wsp\u00f3lne stawianie czo\u0142a wyzwaniom codzienno\u015bci. Nostalgiczny obraz nikn\u0105cego \u015bwiata skrzy si\u0119 bezpretensjonalnym humorem i zachwyca zdj\u0119ciami, oddaj\u0105cymi zniewalaj\u0105cy urok karpackiego pog\u00f3rza. Zwracaj\u0105c uwag\u0119 na szczeg\u00f3\u0142y, re\u017cyserka tworzy wzruszaj\u0105cy film o pami\u0119ci, przyja\u017ani i przemijaniu. Pokazuj\u0105c ludzi, kt\u00f3rzy potrafi\u0105 by\u0107 dla siebie wszystkim, sk\u0142ania nas do przewarto\u015bciowania priorytet\u00f3w i spojrzenia na rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107 z mniej ucz\u0119szczanej strony.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/WWeJxcoEvH0?si=MeApd5ksdM9Q6oq4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D6143","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1780645915.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60127":{"id":60127,"title":"Lalka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-09-29-13-45-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3054\/1789115373.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T13:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 13:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 13:45:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3054,"name":"Lalka ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Nowa ekranizacja \u201eLalki\u201d to opowiedziana ze wsp\u00f3\u0142czesn\u0105 wra\u017cliwo\u015bci\u0105 przejmuj\u0105ca, uniwersalna historia o mi\u0142o\u015bci i niespe\u0142nieniu, o aspiracjach i przemianie, o \u015bwiecie, kt\u00f3ry w\u0142a\u015bnie si\u0119 ko\u0144czy. To film, kt\u00f3ry zdarza si\u0119 raz na kilka dekad: epicki, pe\u0142en emocji, zrealizowany z imponuj\u0105c\u0105 scenografi\u0105, dopracowanymi w najdrobniejszych detalach kostiumami i charakteryzacj\u0105 oraz prawdziwie gwiazdorsk\u0105 obsad\u0105.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eLalka\u201d to zrealizowana z ogromnym rozmachem superprodukcja i najbardziej gwiazdorski film w historii polskiego kina, gdzie po\u015br\u00f3d wielu wybitnych nazwisk, w rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski jako Stanis\u0142aw Wokulski, gwiazda \u201eCh\u0142op\u00f3w\u201d \u2013 Kamila Urz\u0119dowska jako Izabela \u0141\u0119cka oraz powracaj\u0105cy na wielki ekran po 16 latach Marek Kondrat w roli Ignacego Rzeckiego.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div>re\u017cyseria: Maciej Kawalski<\/div><div>aktorzy: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski, Kamila Urz\u0119dowska, Marek Kondrat, Andrzej Seweryn, Maria D\u0119bska<\/div><div>Polska 2026, 162'<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><br><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/UsmL7HKwVWM?si=3IgVscJSbOjSguXT\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3054\/1789115373.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60100":{"id":60100,"title":"Mistyczka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/mistyczka-2026-10-01-14-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T14:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 14:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 14:30:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3059,"name":"Mistyczka ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to poruszaj\u0105ca, inspirowana prawdziwymi wydarzeniami historia kobiety, kt\u00f3ra odwa\u017cy\u0142a si\u0119 p\u00f3j\u015b\u0107 za g\u0142osem serca i przekroczy\u0107 granic\u0119 tego, co znane. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o wewn\u0119trznej przemianie, poszukiwaniu sensu egzystencji i niezwyk\u0142ej drodze, kt\u00f3ra zaprowadzi\u0142a Alicj\u0119 Lenczewsk\u0105 do do\u015bwiadcze\u0144 wykraczaj\u0105cych poza materialn\u0105 rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Przez lata Alicja Lenczewska prowadzi\u0142a dynamiczne \u017cycie. By\u0142a wiernym cz\u0142onkiem partii komunistycznej i cenion\u0105 nauczycielk\u0105 \u2013 wymagaj\u0105c\u0105, odpowiedzialn\u0105 i ca\u0142kowicie oddan\u0105 swojej pracy. Uwielbia\u0142a zagraniczne podr\u00f3\u017ce. Wydawa\u0142o si\u0119, \u017ce jej przysz\u0142o\u015b\u0107 zosta\u0142a ju\u017c dawno napisana. A\u017c do dnia, w kt\u00f3rym jedno spotkanie odmieni\u0142o wszystko\u2026<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wbrew sceptycyzmowi otoczenia i w\u0142asnym l\u0119kom Alicja wkracza na \u015bcie\u017ck\u0119 g\u0142\u0119bokiego \u017cycia duchowego. Jej mistyczne zapiski pe\u0142ne szczero\u015bci, nadziei i m\u0105dro\u015bci z czasem trafiaj\u0105 do tysi\u0119cy ludzi szukaj\u0105cych odpowiedzi na najwa\u017cniejsze pytania o mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107, cierpienie, wiar\u0119 i sens \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Mistyczka to film, kt\u00f3ry porusza serce i sk\u0142ania do refleksji. Intymny portret niezwyk\u0142ej kobiety splata si\u0119 tu z uniwersaln\u0105 opowie\u015bci\u0105 o samotno\u015bci, odwadze i potrzebie odnalezienia \u015bwiat\u0142a nawet w najtrudniejszych momentach \u017cycia.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W roli Alicji Lenczewskiej wyst\u0119puje Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, tworz\u0105c jedn\u0105 z najbardziej poruszaj\u0105cych i dojrza\u0142ych kreacji w swojej karierze.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017c.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Jan Sobierajski<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">obsada&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Rados\u0142aw Pazura, Rafa\u0142 Sza\u0142ajko, Marcin Kwa\u015bny, Dorota Chotecka-Pazura, S\u0142awomir Orzechowski, Dariusz Kowalski, Filip Gur\u0142acz<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/oQiqr0HaqLA?si=lQmbZcfw6CEuHFPd\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3059\/1790076012.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60062":{"id":60062,"title":"Kura ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kura-2026-09-25-15-00-6","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786965128.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T15:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 14:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 15:00:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3030,"name":"Kura ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">G\u0142\u00f3wn\u0105 bohaterk\u0105 nowego filmu w\u0119gierskiego re\u017cysera Gy\u00f6rgya P\u00e1lfiego jest tytu\u0142owa kura. Pozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.<br><br>Trafia do greckiej nadmorskiej wioski, gdzie schwytana zostaje przez w\u0142a\u015bciciela podupad\u0142ej restauracji i si\u0142\u0105 rzeczy \u201ewchodzi\u201d do ludzkiego \u015bwiata. Jest uwa\u017cn\u0105 obserwatork\u0105 zupe\u0142nie obcej dla niej rzeczywisto\u015bci. Staje si\u0119 te\u017c niemym \u015bwiadkiem ludzkich dramat\u00f3w, zwi\u0105zanych z kryzysem migracyjnym, rodzinnymi konfliktami czy chciwo\u015bci\u0105. <br><br>W rol\u0119 g\u0142\u00f3wnej bohaterki wcieli\u0142o si\u0119 osiem prawdziwych w\u0119gierskich kur: Eszti, Szandi, Feri, Enci, Eti, Enik\u0151, N\u00f3ra i Anett. <br><br>Przyjmuj\u0105c nieoczywist\u0105 perspektyw\u0119, P\u00e1lfi opowiada o uniwersalnych warto\u015bciach \u2013 wolno\u015bci, bezpiecze\u0144stwie, macierzy\u0144stwie \u2013 jakich poszukuj\u0105 jak wida\u0107 nie tylko ludzie. W\u0119gierski re\u017cyser odwa\u017cnie \u0142\u0105czy filmowe gatunki, tworz\u0105c histori\u0119, kt\u00f3ra z jednej strony mo\u017ce nas bawi\u0107, a z drugiej jest prawdziwie poruszaj\u0105ca.<\/span><\/font>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/L78WO1p_xnA?si=GsO3moP7sAFn8x5D\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D10792","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786965128.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60088":{"id":60088,"title":"Obcy ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/obcy-2026-10-01-16-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","date":"2026-10-01T16:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":35,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 15:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 16:15:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":35}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3022,"name":"Obcy ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d w re\u017cyserii Fran\u00e7ois Ozona to nowa ekranizacja jednej z najwybitniejszych francuskich powie\u015bci XX wieku autorstwa Alberta Camusa. Prezentowana w Konkursie G\u0142\u00f3wnym festiwalu w Wenecji&nbsp; to wci\u0105\u017c niezwykle aktualna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu sensu w \u015bwiecie, w kt\u00f3rym wszelki sens zosta\u0142 zagubiony.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eObcy\u201d jest histori\u0105 Meursaulta, m\u0142odego m\u0119\u017cczyzny, skromnego urz\u0119dnika, kt\u00f3rego codziennej rutyny nie przerywa nawet \u015bmier\u0107 matki. Wszystko zmienia si\u0119 pewnego gor\u0105cego dnia, gdy na pla\u017cy dochodzi do tragicznego zdarzenia z jego udzia\u0142em.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Oszcz\u0119dne dialogi i pi\u0119kne czarno-bia\u0142e zdj\u0119cia, b\u0119d\u0105ce ho\u0142dem dla klasycznego kina, buduj\u0105 wyj\u0105tkow\u0105 atmosfer\u0119 filmu.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Re\u017cyseria: Fran\u00e7ois Ozon<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Benjamin Voisin, Rebecca Marder, Pierre Lottin, Denis Lavant, Swann Arlaud<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Francja 2025, 122'<\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/b2yaQbsNAk0?si=m6suXUoNcKv7bWOG\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2025T2D10184","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3022\/1789034261.png","artists":[]},"location":{"id":8,"name":"Galeria Bronowice","institution_name":"Mikro Bronowice","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-001","addresse":"ul. Stawowa 61"}},"60048":{"id":60048,"title":"Orlando ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/orlando-2026-09-25-16-45-6","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3050\/1789035126.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T16:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 16:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 16:45:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3050,"name":"Orlando ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">W roku 1600 Orlando, m\u0142odzieniec z arystokratycznego rodu (Tilda Swinton), zostaje obrzucony kl\u0105tw\u0105 \"bycia m\u0142odym na wieki\" przez oczarowan\u0105 jego urod\u0105 kr\u00f3low\u0105 El\u017cbiet\u0119 I. 200 lat p\u00f3\u017aniej zostaje kobiet\u0105, kt\u00f3rej losy \u015bledzimy a\u017c po lata nam wsp\u00f3lczesne. Ubrana w pi\u0119kne obrazy lekko ironiczna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu w\u0142asnej to\u017csamo\u015bci. Film powsta\u0142 na podstawie powie\u015bci Virginii Wolf.<\/span><\/font><div><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017cyseria<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t<\/span>Sally Potter<\/span><\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Scenariusz Sally Potter<\/span><\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Obsada&nbsp;<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t<\/span>Tilda Swinton, Quentin Crisp, John Bott, Elaine Banham, Anna Farnworth<\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/div><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/SbT1KRbOn7o?si=a1OJGVu5KQsn5Tig\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"1992T2D454","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3050\/1789035126.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60028":{"id":60028,"title":"Lalka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-09-30-16-45-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3054\/1789115373.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T16:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":119,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 16:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-11 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 16:45:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":119}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3054,"name":"Lalka ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Nowa ekranizacja \u201eLalki\u201d to opowiedziana ze wsp\u00f3\u0142czesn\u0105 wra\u017cliwo\u015bci\u0105 przejmuj\u0105ca, uniwersalna historia o mi\u0142o\u015bci i niespe\u0142nieniu, o aspiracjach i przemianie, o \u015bwiecie, kt\u00f3ry w\u0142a\u015bnie si\u0119 ko\u0144czy. To film, kt\u00f3ry zdarza si\u0119 raz na kilka dekad: epicki, pe\u0142en emocji, zrealizowany z imponuj\u0105c\u0105 scenografi\u0105, dopracowanymi w najdrobniejszych detalach kostiumami i charakteryzacj\u0105 oraz prawdziwie gwiazdorsk\u0105 obsad\u0105.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eLalka\u201d to zrealizowana z ogromnym rozmachem superprodukcja i najbardziej gwiazdorski film w historii polskiego kina, gdzie po\u015br\u00f3d wielu wybitnych nazwisk, w rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski jako Stanis\u0142aw Wokulski, gwiazda \u201eCh\u0142op\u00f3w\u201d \u2013 Kamila Urz\u0119dowska jako Izabela \u0141\u0119cka oraz powracaj\u0105cy na wielki ekran po 16 latach Marek Kondrat w roli Ignacego Rzeckiego.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div>re\u017cyseria: Maciej Kawalski<\/div><div>aktorzy: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski, Kamila Urz\u0119dowska, Marek Kondrat, Andrzej Seweryn, Maria D\u0119bska<\/div><div>Polska 2026, 162'<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><br><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/UsmL7HKwVWM?si=3IgVscJSbOjSguXT\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3054\/1789115373.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60055":{"id":60055,"title":"Birthday Party ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/birthday-party-2026-09-25-18-30-6","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1790073908.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T18:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 18:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 18:30:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3057,"name":"Birthday Party ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wp\u0142ywowy grecki magnat \u015bwi\u0119tuje 25. urodziny c\u00f3rki na prywatnej wyspie otoczony gronem najpot\u0119\u017cniejszych ludzi \u015bwiata. W miar\u0119 rozwoju przyj\u0119cia na jaw zaczynaj\u0105 wychodzi\u0107 mroczne sekrety zebranych.<\/span><\/font><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">re\u017c. Miguel \u00c1ngel Jim\u00e9nez<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">obsada&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t<\/span>Willem Dafoe, Vic Carmen Sonne, Joe Cole<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div style=\"\">produkcja: Grecja, Hiszpania, Holandia, Wielka Brytania 2026<\/div><div style=\"\">j\u0119zyk: angielski<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/q66_3aPe6OA?si=5QPi75GoE7XsBJG6\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1790073908.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60030":{"id":60030,"title":"Lalka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-01-19-45","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3054\/1789115373.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T19:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 19:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-11 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 19:45:00"},"products":[{"id":113,"name":"Bilet normalny 27","rawPrice":2700,"price":"27,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3054,"name":"Lalka ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Nowa ekranizacja \u201eLalki\u201d to opowiedziana ze wsp\u00f3\u0142czesn\u0105 wra\u017cliwo\u015bci\u0105 przejmuj\u0105ca, uniwersalna historia o mi\u0142o\u015bci i niespe\u0142nieniu, o aspiracjach i przemianie, o \u015bwiecie, kt\u00f3ry w\u0142a\u015bnie si\u0119 ko\u0144czy. To film, kt\u00f3ry zdarza si\u0119 raz na kilka dekad: epicki, pe\u0142en emocji, zrealizowany z imponuj\u0105c\u0105 scenografi\u0105, dopracowanymi w najdrobniejszych detalach kostiumami i charakteryzacj\u0105 oraz prawdziwie gwiazdorsk\u0105 obsad\u0105.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eLalka\u201d to zrealizowana z ogromnym rozmachem superprodukcja i najbardziej gwiazdorski film w historii polskiego kina, gdzie po\u015br\u00f3d wielu wybitnych nazwisk, w rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski jako Stanis\u0142aw Wokulski, gwiazda \u201eCh\u0142op\u00f3w\u201d \u2013 Kamila Urz\u0119dowska jako Izabela \u0141\u0119cka oraz powracaj\u0105cy na wielki ekran po 16 latach Marek Kondrat w roli Ignacego Rzeckiego.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div>re\u017cyseria: Maciej Kawalski<\/div><div>aktorzy: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski, Kamila Urz\u0119dowska, Marek Kondrat, Andrzej Seweryn, Maria D\u0119bska<\/div><div>Polska 2026, 162'<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><br><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/UsmL7HKwVWM?si=3IgVscJSbOjSguXT\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3054\/1789115373.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60041":{"id":60041,"title":"Requiem dla snu  ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/requiem-dla-snu-2026-09-25-20-30-6","image":"\/uploads\/event\/2997\/1784032934.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T20:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":14,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 20:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-22 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":57,"name":"Bilet  normalny 26","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":14}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2997,"name":"Requiem dla snu  ","description":"<font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to drugi pe\u0142nometra\u017cowy film Darrena Aronofsky\u2019ego, na podstawie powie\u015bci legendarnego ameryka\u0144skiego pisarza, Huberta Selby\u2019ego Jr. \u0106wier\u0107 wieku temu trafi\u0142 do Polski dzi\u0119ki dystrybucji Gutek Film i wry\u0142 si\u0119 w nasz\u0105 popkultur\u0119 tak g\u0142\u0119boko, \u017ce sta\u0142 si\u0119 niezwykle wa\u017cnym tekstem kultury, cytowanym przez pisarzy, tw\u00f3rc\u00f3w teatralnych i raper\u00f3w. M\u0142odzi wtedy aktorzy - Jared Leto, Jennifer Connelly i Marlon Wayans - z dnia na dzie\u0144 trafili na hollywoodzki szczyt, hipnotyzuj\u0105cy popis Ellen Burstyn przyni\u00f3s\u0142 jej nominacj\u0119 do Oscara, a sam re\u017cyser udowodni\u0142, \u017ce jest wizjonerem kina. Teraz, po 25 latach od premiery, film powraca do kin w odrestaurowanej wersji 4K. <br><br>\u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to wstrz\u0105saj\u0105ca opowie\u015b\u0107 o czw\u00f3rce bohater\u00f3w z Brooklynu, kt\u00f3rzy w pogoni za realizacj\u0105 swoich marze\u0144 odbywaj\u0105 podr\u00f3\u017c w g\u0142\u0105b piek\u0142a uzale\u017cnie\u0144. Dla rozprowadzaj\u0105cego narkotyki Harry'ego (Leto), jego uzale\u017cnionej od pigu\u0142ek na odchudzanie matki (Burstyn), pogr\u0105\u017conej w na\u0142ogu dziewczyny (Connelly) i najlepszego przyjaciela (Wayans) ucieczka od rzeczywisto\u015bci ko\u0144czy si\u0119 tragedi\u0105. Nie mog\u0105c sobie poradzi\u0107 z chaosem otaczaj\u0105cego ich wsp\u00f3\u0142czesnego \u015bwiata, ka\u017cde z nich popada w uzale\u017cnienie - od narkotyk\u00f3w, s\u0142odyczy lub telewizji.&nbsp; \u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to hipnotyczna opowie\u015b\u0107 o t\u0119sknocie za mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105, \u017cyciu w iluzji i k\u0142amstwie oraz o pu\u0142apce na\u0142ogu. <br><br>Ekranowego dramatu bohater\u00f3w dope\u0142nia genialny, \u015bwidruj\u0105cy m\u00f3zg soundtrack Clinta Mansella w wykonaniu Kronos Quartet. Motyw Lux Aeterna to muzyczny klasyk, po dzi\u015b dzie\u0144 bezlito\u015bnie przerabiany i samplowany. A samo \u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d, ogl\u0105dane po latach, wci\u0105\u017c funduje widzom szokuj\u0105cy, emocjonalny rollercoaster, po kt\u00f3rym trudno doj\u015b\u0107 do siebie.<\/span><\/font>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2001T2D135","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/2997\/1784032934.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":13,"name":"Sala Mikroffala","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60026":{"id":60026,"title":"Lalka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-02-13-45","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3054\/1789115373.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T13:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 13:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-11 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 13:45:00"},"products":[{"id":29,"name":"bilet normalny 29","rawPrice":2900,"price":"29,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3054,"name":"Lalka ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Nowa ekranizacja \u201eLalki\u201d to opowiedziana ze wsp\u00f3\u0142czesn\u0105 wra\u017cliwo\u015bci\u0105 przejmuj\u0105ca, uniwersalna historia o mi\u0142o\u015bci i niespe\u0142nieniu, o aspiracjach i przemianie, o \u015bwiecie, kt\u00f3ry w\u0142a\u015bnie si\u0119 ko\u0144czy. To film, kt\u00f3ry zdarza si\u0119 raz na kilka dekad: epicki, pe\u0142en emocji, zrealizowany z imponuj\u0105c\u0105 scenografi\u0105, dopracowanymi w najdrobniejszych detalach kostiumami i charakteryzacj\u0105 oraz prawdziwie gwiazdorsk\u0105 obsad\u0105.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eLalka\u201d to zrealizowana z ogromnym rozmachem superprodukcja i najbardziej gwiazdorski film w historii polskiego kina, gdzie po\u015br\u00f3d wielu wybitnych nazwisk, w rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski jako Stanis\u0142aw Wokulski, gwiazda \u201eCh\u0142op\u00f3w\u201d \u2013 Kamila Urz\u0119dowska jako Izabela \u0141\u0119cka oraz powracaj\u0105cy na wielki ekran po 16 latach Marek Kondrat w roli Ignacego Rzeckiego.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div>re\u017cyseria: Maciej Kawalski<\/div><div>aktorzy: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski, Kamila Urz\u0119dowska, Marek Kondrat, Andrzej Seweryn, Maria D\u0119bska<\/div><div>Polska 2026, 162'<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><br><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/UsmL7HKwVWM?si=3IgVscJSbOjSguXT\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/3054\/1789115373.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Mikro","institution_name":"Kino Mikro","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Krak\u00f3w","city_id":2184,"zip":"30-046","addresse":"ul. Juliusza Lea 5"}},"60023":{"id":60023,"title":"Lalka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-02-16-45","image":"\/uploads\/event\/3054\/1789115373.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T16:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":123,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 16:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-11 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 16:45:00"},"products":[{"id":29,"name":"bilet normalny 29","rawPrice":2900,"price":"29,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":123}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3054,"name":"Lalka ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Nowa ekranizacja \u201eLalki\u201d to opowiedziana ze wsp\u00f3\u0142czesn\u0105 wra\u017cliwo\u015bci\u0105 przejmuj\u0105ca, uniwersalna historia o mi\u0142o\u015bci i niespe\u0142nieniu, o aspiracjach i przemianie, o \u015bwiecie, kt\u00f3ry w\u0142a\u015bnie si\u0119 ko\u0144czy. To film, kt\u00f3ry zdarza si\u0119 raz na kilka dekad: epicki, pe\u0142en emocji, zrealizowany z imponuj\u0105c\u0105 scenografi\u0105, dopracowanymi w najdrobniejszych detalach kostiumami i charakteryzacj\u0105 oraz prawdziwie gwiazdorsk\u0105 obsad\u0105.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u201eLalka\u201d to zrealizowana z ogromnym rozmachem superprodukcja i najbardziej gwiazdorski film w historii polskiego kina, gdzie po\u015br\u00f3d wielu wybitnych nazwisk, w rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych wyst\u0119puj\u0105: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski jako Stanis\u0142aw Wokulski, gwiazda \u201eCh\u0142op\u00f3w\u201d \u2013 Kamila Urz\u0119dowska jako Izabela \u0141\u0119cka oraz powracaj\u0105cy na wielki ekran po 16 latach Marek Kondrat w roli Ignacego Rzeckiego.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><div>re\u017cyseria: Maciej Kawalski<\/div><div>aktorzy: Marcin Doroci\u0144ski, Kamila Urz\u0119dowska, Marek Kondrat, Andrzej Seweryn, Maria D\u0119bska<\/div><div>Polska 2026, 162'<\/div><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><br><\/div>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/UsmL7HKwVWM?si=3IgVscJSbOjSguXT\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-i